easily! I'll get rashes.

247
00:16:44.751 --> 00:16:46.563
Hey, just tells us
what you want from us?

248
00:16:46.878 --> 00:16:48.924
Why have you tied us to a chair
in this sweltering heat?

249
00:16:49.275 --> 00:16:50.920
My baby is alone at home.

250
00:16:51.120 --> 00:16:53.029
Mrs. Babli, he's coming all the way
from Lucknow.

251
00:16:53.253 --> 00:16:53.702
Who?

252
00:16:53.966 --> 00:16:54.998
He'll tell you once he's here.

253
00:16:55.165 --> 00:16:56.523
"He" Who?

254
00:16:58.153 --> 00:16:59.418
Is it Inspector Dashrath Singh?

255
00:16:59.659 --> 00:17:02.426
Dashrath Singh has long since retired.

256
00:17:02.702 --> 00:17:04.437
You'll see for yourself.

257
00:17:07.946 --> 00:17:09.474
Man, there's a train approaching!

258
00:17:09.835 --> 00:17:11.612
Get us off this track!

259
00:17:11.817 --> 00:17:13.601
Who's gonna take care of the house,
if I'm wounded?

260
00:17:13.790 --> 00:17:16.597
I've left the washing machine on
and the veggies on the stove.

261
00:17:16.792 --> 00:17:19.176
My little boy will pass out
if doesn't get his meal on time!

262
00:17:19.373 --> 00:17:20.792
Will you say something Rakesh?!

263
00:17:20.952 --> 00:17:23.612
I will, if you ever let me
get a word in!

264
00:17:23.922 --> 00:17:26.363
Bro... why are you guys
hell bent on...

265
00:17:26.535 --> 00:17:28.891
...turning this family drama
into an action film?!

266
00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:34.005
The train's almost here Rakesh!
Pappu...

267
00:18:04.283 --> 00:18:06.827
He'd announced he'll come for them
on the same train...

268
00:18:07.046 --> 00:18:08.882
...Dashrath sir had let them off in.

269
00:18:09.251 --> 00:18:12.005
And now he's arrived
on a bloody survey cart.

270
00:18:21.004 --> 00:18:21.546
Sir...

271
00:18:24.788 --> 00:18:26.189
Are we there?

272
00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:30.879
Gupta, this is blasphemy!

273
00:18:31.321 --> 00:18:34.413
Untie them... they're celebrities man!

274
00:18:34.702 --> 00:18:35.914
Of course, sir.

275
00:18:38.481 --> 00:18:40.456
Myself Jatayu Singh.

276
00:18:42.083 --> 00:18:47.126
I feel blessed to be in your
company yet again!

277
00:18:47.519 --> 00:18:49.733
Yet again?
When did we meet before?

278
00:18:49.929 --> 00:18:54.961
Dude, I was part of Dashrath sir's
troop... more of a backbencher.

279
00:19:00.313 --> 00:19:01.896
Strange are the wheels
of destiny...

280
00:19:02.053 --> 00:19:05.026
The backbencher is now in front and
those in front stand sidelined!

281
00:19:05.286 --> 00:19:06.268
Isn't Mr. Gupta?

282
00:19:08.229 --> 00:19:12.152
I'm your biggest fan!

283
00:19:12.663 --> 00:19:15.747
This morning we received
a nation-wide red alert...

284
00:19:16.052 --> 00:19:20.368
...that Bunty and Babli
have struck again!

285
00:19:21.647 --> 00:19:24.424
I must say the 'Virgin conjob'
was sheer genius!

286
00:19:24.775 --> 00:19:25.965
Virgin con job?

287
00:19:26.255 --> 00:19:29.068
At least last time around... you sold
Taj Mahal to a bunch of foreigners...

288
00:19:29.225 --> 00:19:30.189
which is real.

289
00:19:30.425 --> 00:19:33.986
But this time you sold a country
to your own countrymen...

290
00:19:34.210 --> 00:19:35.566
...that doesn't even exist!

291
00:19:35.910 --> 00:19:40.798
That's some upgrade...
Bunty and Babli 2.0!

292
00:19:41.046 --> 00:19:42.651
What nonsense!

293
00:19:43.007 --> 00:19:44.596
We've not sold anything to anyone.

294
00:19:44.783 --> 00:19:46.424
We gave up this line of work
a long time back.

295
00:19:46.744 --> 00:19:48.504
- Mr. Gupta.
- Yes sir.

296
00:19:48.827 --> 00:19:51.221
Please do the honours.
Kindly broadcast it!

297
00:19:51.408 --> 00:19:52.156
Yes.

298
00:19:53.167 --> 00:19:54.710
- Broadcast?
- Here we go.

299
00:19:54.948 --> 00:19:59.090
We're about to show you
how these two conned...

300
00:19:59.310 --> 00:20:01.899
...a bunch of Delhi businessmen
with the lure of easy sex.

301
00:20:02.242 --> 00:20:06.063
In a made-up country called Virgin
Republic where "anything goes".

302
00:20:06.428 --> 00:20:08.311
...but left them with nothing.

303
00:20:08.621 --> 00:20:13.806
These conmen are none other than
the long retired and famous thugs -

304
00:20:14.111 --> 00:20:15.628
Bunty and Babli!

305
00:20:15.887 --> 00:20:17.280
No, no sir, we didn't do this.

306
00:20:17.465 --> 00:20:19.582
Sir this is amateurish.

307
00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:21.611
Any two-bit swindler
can pull this off.

308
00:20:21.840 --> 00:20:24.968
Set the mood with the pics
of hot girls,

309
00:20:25.164 --> 00:20:28.807
jazz it up with some fancy English
and promise low risk-high reward.

310
00:20:29.138 --> 00:20:32.121
Swanky hotel, big cars
and cash payments.

311
00:20:32.363 --> 00:20:33.514
No Vimmi?

312
00:20:34.206 --> 00:20:36.368
Impressive Mr. Bunty...

313
00:20:37.151 --> 00:20:40.001
Just because Tendulkar has retired...

314
00:20:40.226 --> 00:20:43.329
...you think he's forgotten
how to hit the ball?

315
00:20:43.598 --> 00:20:47.314
We didn't do this dirty con-job!
We're a simple Indian family now.

316
00:20:47.618 --> 00:20:48.814
That's some story!

317
00:20:49.031 --> 00:20:52.502
It's your style, your names
and your calling card...

318
00:20:52.816 --> 00:20:56.347
and yet we're supposed
to believe that this isn't you?!

319
00:20:56.683 --> 00:20:57.266
Yes.

320
00:20:57.487 --> 00:21:01.864
Our conning days are like hair
on a bald head.

321
00:21:02.086 --> 00:21:04.708
Once upon a time.

322
00:21:05.260 --> 00:21:06.720
Well said.

323
00:21:08.814 --> 00:21:09.897
Bravo Rakesh!

324
00:21:10.382 --> 00:21:13.530
Our only highlights these days
is either figuring out cooking gas...

325
00:21:13.827 --> 00:21:15.715
...or playing down Pappu's
mischief in school...

326
00:21:15.907 --> 00:21:19.271
...or finding gray hair on our heads!

327
00:21:20.072 --> 00:21:23.492
We were at the Mr. Mishra's house...
for his son's baptism ceremony.

328
00:21:23.866 --> 00:21:26.905
Pappu even put out some photos
and videos on that...er...

329
00:21:27.189 --> 00:21:27.718
Facebook!

330
00:21:27.906 --> 00:21:31.282
Ya, he's shared them on Facebook.
Feel free to check.

331
00:21:32.280 --> 00:21:35.694
I've been a ticket checker
at local train station for years.

332
00:21:35.983 --> 00:21:38.228
They use a biometric scanner
every time.

333
00:21:38.541 --> 00:21:40.863
Have to thumb-scan
even when I go for a piss.

334
00:21:41.075 --> 00:21:42.740
You can check the record!

335
00:21:44.600 --> 00:21:47.459
Sir, I think they're telling
the truth.

336
00:21:47.702 --> 00:21:51.191
I doubt their family duties leaves
them time for anything else!

337
00:21:51.429 --> 00:21:52.203
No!

338
00:21:52.628 --> 00:21:56.309
These guys are thoroughbred liars.
I'm sure they're messing with us.

339
00:21:56.771 --> 00:21:59.476
Keep them locked for a few days.

340
00:22:00.023 --> 00:22:01.236
Ok sir.

341
00:22:02.713 --> 00:22:07.650
But if they didn't do it,
then who could it be?

342
00:22:08.747 --> 00:22:13.190
You need to stop fingering
your phone 24 hours a day.

343
00:22:13.371 --> 00:22:14.512
I'm on Tinder dad.

344
00:22:14.670 --> 00:22:16.725
- Namaste Mr. Chaubey.
- Namaste!

345
00:22:17.232 --> 00:22:18.286
Who's this chick?

346
00:22:18.528 --> 00:22:19.993
She's... just a friend.

347
00:22:20.192 --> 00:22:22.044
Just a friend my foot!

348
00:22:22.262 --> 00:22:24.885
Stop right there.
You can't go ahead.

349
00:22:25.347 --> 00:22:28.388
Hey watch your tone,
I'm the mayor of this town.

350
00:22:28.679 --> 00:22:31.796
I mean there's a bunch of VIPs
up ahead. It's NO ENTRY!

351
00:22:32.384 --> 00:22:34.521
That equipment. Show me.

352
00:22:34.684 --> 00:22:36.151
Dad, Black Cat Commandos!

353
00:22:36.392 --> 00:22:39.573
Hail Mother India!
Long live the revolution!

354
00:22:40.712 --> 00:22:41.498
Who is he?

355
00:22:43.157 --> 00:22:44.383
He's my son.

356
00:22:46.630 --> 00:22:48.496
You tell me who is that!

357
00:22:48.827 --> 00:22:50.983
She is Prime Minister's
scientific advisor,

358
00:22:51.303 --> 00:22:54.338
specially appointed to oversee
the cleaning of River Ganga!

359
00:22:54.527 --> 00:22:56.777
No, it's very bad.

360
00:22:57.065 --> 00:22:58.446
Let's go Shekhar.

361
00:22:58.627 --> 00:22:59.632
Madam it will be cleaned.

362
00:22:59.818 --> 00:23:00.468
USELESS!

363
00:23:00.746 --> 00:23:01.771
And who's this guy?

364
00:23:01.953 --> 00:23:05.036
Doesn't look like her son...
must be her secretary!

365
00:23:05.249 --> 00:23:06.421
You're wasting time.

366
00:23:06.634 --> 00:23:08.704
No ma'am, processing data
is taking too much time.

367
00:23:08.940 --> 00:23:10.850
Useless tools... useless people.

368
00:23:11.754 --> 00:23:16.281
Prime Minister's Scientific advisor...

369
00:23:21.042 --> 00:23:22.827
We've to get in on this!

370
00:23:35.962 --> 00:23:37.989
I'm Chutvaa Chaubey!

371
00:23:39.888 --> 00:23:40.870
KL Shekhar.

372
00:23:41.094 --> 00:23:44.657
I know you're from the
Prime Minister's office.

373
00:23:45.026 --> 00:23:49.020
We are honoured sir...
and so is our town!

374
00:23:49.257 --> 00:23:50.253
Hey! What're you doing?

375
00:23:50.438 --> 00:23:52.364
Please make me meet your madam?

376
00:23:52.841 --> 00:23:55.425
What is this! Stop tickling me...

377
00:23:55.735 --> 00:23:56.938
Don't you like tickles!

378
00:23:57.158 --> 00:23:58.322
Sir, you will get wet!

379
00:23:58.523 --> 00:23:59.563
- What?
- Splash back!

380
00:23:59.738 --> 00:24:01.578
I can handle such splashes.

381
00:24:01.755 --> 00:24:02.916
I'm the mayor of this town.

382
00:24:03.140 --> 00:24:05.469
- We need to follow the procedure.
- To hell with procedures!

383
00:24:05.658 --> 00:24:07.469
Ok, ok.

384
00:24:10.897 --> 00:24:13.643
Our river Ganga! For lease!?

385
00:24:15.523 --> 00:24:16.433
Meaning?

386
00:24:16.835 --> 00:24:18.808
Meaning anyone can lease the river!

387
00:24:19.106 --> 00:24:20.437
Ganga!

388
00:24:22.309 --> 00:24:23.089
How?

389
00:24:23.416 --> 00:24:25.606
As part of Public-Private
partnerships...

390
00:24:26.147 --> 00:24:28.922
...the government will grant
one company in every city...

391
00:24:29.126 --> 00:24:30.451
...rights to clean the river.

392
00:24:30.998 --> 00:24:34.786
In return, the company can use
the river water however it wants...

393
00:24:34.951 --> 00:24:36.919
...to recover its investments.

394
00:24:37.613 --> 00:24:42.395
Wow... Unbelievable!

395
00:24:43.188 --> 00:24:43.967
Hey Golu!

396
00:24:44.343 --> 00:24:46.392
He's my son - Golu Chaubey!

397
00:24:48.000 --> 00:24:49.747
I am public, he is private!

398
00:24:50.025 --> 00:24:52.527
There's your public-private
partnership.

399
00:24:55.400 --> 00:24:57.214
It's so simple!

400
00:24:57.540 --> 00:25:01.493
You can give Golu's company
the contract for our city...

401
00:25:01.758 --> 00:25:07.255
And we can figure out what you need
to make that happen!

402
00:25:07.563 --> 00:25:09.710
It's not that simple Mr. Chaubey.

403
00:25:10.036 --> 00:25:14.189
I'll get this river so bloody clean
within 2 days...

404
00:25:14.468 --> 00:25:16.274
...that you'll be able to see
the riverbed!

405
00:25:16.880 --> 00:25:18.374
- Two days?
- Two days.

406
00:25:18.552 --> 00:25:21.052
Okay, stop wasting my time like this!

407
00:25:21.222 --> 00:25:23.045
I can't find her online at all.

408
00:25:23.255 --> 00:25:25.405
- What are you saying...?
- Zilch! Have a look.

409
00:25:25.585 --> 00:25:26.542
NO RESULTS FOUND

410
00:25:27.132 --> 00:25:28.349
- Golu.
- What?

411
00:25:28.646 --> 00:25:33.934
Golu says the internet doesn't
seem to recognise you.

412
00:25:34.173 --> 00:25:35.489
- There's nothing.
- Zero.

413
00:25:36.051 --> 00:25:36.770
Nil.

414
00:25:42.762 --> 00:25:44.714
- What the hell Shekhar?!
- Yes ma'am?

415
00:25:44.949 --> 00:25:47.859
You still haven't added my name
to the PMO's website?

416
00:25:48.822 --> 00:25:51.689
Ma'am I had informed
the IT department...

417
00:25:51.907 --> 00:25:52.970
And then?

418
00:25:53.372 --> 00:25:54.722
Must've been delayed...

419
00:25:55.065 --> 00:25:57.304
And what about this nonsense?!

420
00:25:57.700 --> 00:25:58.575
Meaning?

421
00:25:58.759 --> 00:26:01.167
Now because of your delay...

422
00:26:01.327 --> 00:26:03.299
...some random guy is questioning
my authority!

423
00:26:03.453 --> 00:26:05.656
I'm not some random guy...
I'm the mayor madam!

424
00:26:05.873 --> 00:26:07.025
- Is this okay?
- No ma'am.

425
00:26:07.199 --> 00:26:09.319
- Then what to do?
- I will just check it.

426
00:26:09.717 --> 00:26:11.794
No need... Forget about it...
thank you very much.

427
00:26:12.034 --> 00:26:12.901
This meeting is over!

428
00:26:13.068 --> 00:26:15.772
No no no, give me one minute ma'am.

429
00:26:15.977 --> 00:26:16.364
Yes?

430
00:26:16.604 --> 00:26:17.989
I respect ladies...

431
00:26:18.397 --> 00:26:19.594
Golu, say sorry!

432
00:26:19.775 --> 00:26:21.184
Ma'am, please pardon our blunder.

433
00:26:21.466 --> 00:26:23.446
- Listen Golum...
- His name is Golu.

434
00:26:23.766 --> 00:26:24.536
Same thing.

435
00:26:24.834 --> 00:26:26.297
Your internet is a god or what?

436
00:26:26.637 --> 00:26:28.351
If I am not on internet...
do I not exist?

437
00:26:28.622 --> 00:26:29.643
Luvju. (Love You)

438
00:26:29.937 --> 00:26:30.958
It's ringing mister.

439
00:26:31.138 --> 00:26:32.668
- What is?
- Your phone!

440
00:26:33.004 --> 00:26:34.738
Bloody hell...

441
00:26:35.916 --> 00:26:36.405
Hello!

442
00:26:36.608 --> 00:26:37.498
Where are you mate?

443
00:26:37.662 --> 00:26:38.794
Just grabbing a bite bro.

444
00:26:39.016 --> 00:26:40.844
Why haven't you added madam's
name to the website?

445
00:26:41.017 --> 00:26:41.926
Crap!

446
00:26:42.232 --> 00:26:44.162
I forgot to redirect the hotel router!

447
00:26:44.371 --> 00:26:45.721
You'll get us killed! Hurry up!

448
00:26:45.938 --> 00:26:47.002
Give me 30 seconds.

449
00:26:51.076 --> 00:26:54.905
You seem to be quite
the internet geek, tell me...

450
00:26:57.549 --> 00:27:00.069
How many followers do you have
on social media?

451
00:27:00.403 --> 00:27:00.969
4,000!

452
00:27:01.200 --> 00:27:02.893
4000. What is your neighbour's name?

453
00:27:03.087 --> 00:27:04.498
- Err... I don't know.
- Shameless!

454
00:27:04.718 --> 00:27:07.075
How will you know if you're
always buried in your phone?

455
00:27:07.647 --> 00:27:08.359
Come on...

456
00:27:08.584 --> 00:27:11.759
What is the first thing you do, when
you go on internet... I want to see.

457
00:27:12.189 --> 00:27:13.727
- My battery is low.
- Is it?

458
00:27:13.924 --> 00:27:15.433
Lying in front of your father!

459
00:27:16.301 --> 00:27:17.001
Done!

460
00:27:17.632 --> 00:27:19.505
Get a grip on your son...
he's out of control.

461
00:27:19.842 --> 00:27:22.217
Mr. Golu Chaubey, check, check.

462
00:27:22.437 --> 00:27:25.275
Madam's name on PMO site
under officials name.

463
00:27:27.947 --> 00:27:28.663
See?

464
00:27:29.495 --> 00:27:31.354
There's enough battery for that.

465
00:27:34.179 --> 00:27:34.717
Yes.

466
00:27:39.772 --> 00:27:40.674
It's...there.

467
00:27:41.916 --> 00:27:46.363
It's there? Apologies to her
right now... little brat!

468
00:27:47.401 --> 00:27:51.441
Ma'am, we've made a huge mistake.
Please forgive me!

469
00:27:52.486 --> 00:27:54.381
Can we start tomorrow please?

470
00:28:06.657 --> 00:28:09.282
Keep going...
Get it all done.

471
00:28:09.891 --> 00:28:12.242
It should be sparkling clean.

472
00:28:12.509 --> 00:28:14.817
Squeeze it all out!

473
00:28:15.029 --> 00:28:15.935
Come on, faster!

474
00:28:16.089 --> 00:28:17.436
Photographer! Click me.

475
00:28:17.722 --> 00:28:19.776
Stop pulling over there...
this is the spot.

476
00:28:20.109 --> 00:28:23.397
Right there. Ya!

477
00:28:29.202 --> 00:28:29.945
LASH GHAT

478
00:28:38.757 --> 00:28:39.825
KAILASH GHAT

479
00:28:49.999 --> 00:28:51.543
Mr. Priest!!!

480
00:28:53.721 --> 00:28:55.056
No!!!

481
00:28:57.434 --> 00:29:00.994
Long live our holy river!

482
00:29:24.100 --> 00:29:25.288
Sir.

483
00:29:37.172 --> 00:29:39.046
Long live the holy Ganga!

484
00:29:40.513 --> 00:29:41.543
God bless you.

485
00:29:47.688 --> 00:29:48.609
Ganga Lease Agreement

486
00:29:49.188 --> 00:29:55.466
I still can't believe someone's actually
leased out the river Ganga to us!

487
00:29:56.047 --> 00:29:57.118
Neither can we!

488
00:30:00.200 --> 00:30:01.690
Golu Mineral Water

489
00:30:02.130 --> 00:30:03.818
[chanting Hindu shlokas]

490
00:30:07.126 --> 00:30:09.004
Are you trying to break it?

491
00:30:11.965 --> 00:30:14.625
How dare you stop me!

492
00:30:14.960 --> 00:30:17.619
I stopped you because
we've received a tip that...

493
00:30:17.879 --> 00:30:20.017
...you're about to sell the Ganga water
without permission!

494
00:30:20.206 --> 00:30:21.992
I deal with the Prime Minister's
office!

495
00:30:22.181 --> 00:30:24.026
I've leased ganga for the next 5 years.

496
00:30:24.201 --> 00:30:26.709
No one can stop me.
I can do whatever I want.

497
00:30:26.988 --> 00:30:27.850
Show him the permit!

498
00:30:28.030 --> 00:30:30.177
Here, read this.
It's in English though.

499
00:30:30.412 --> 00:30:32.892
Lemme know if you want me
to read it out for you!

500
00:30:33.320 --> 00:30:35.473
Sir, this is from Ms. Malini
and Mr. Shekhar.

501
00:30:39.119 --> 00:30:41.349
Mr. Mayor got played
by Bunty and Babli!

502
