561
00:34:16.188 --> 00:34:18.482
Millions! You get it? It's no joke.

562
00:34:18.748 --> 00:34:19.939
- Now, let's go.
- Where?

563
00:34:21.431 --> 00:34:24.753
I know we decided to do this
only once or twice...

564
00:34:25.107 --> 00:34:28.068
...but now I'm wondering...
why stop?

565
00:34:28.547 --> 00:34:32.961
In fact, I'm beginning to understand
why Honesty just isn't the best policy!

566
00:34:33.139 --> 00:34:34.007
Why?

567
00:34:34.338 --> 00:34:37.387
Because dishonesty is so god-damned
easy!!? And so much fun!

568
00:34:37.774 --> 00:34:41.145
Yeah... but if we do this for too long
we're bound to end up in jail!

569
00:34:41.450 --> 00:34:45.086
As soon as I have enough money
for my app... I'm out.

570
00:34:45.309 --> 00:34:46.598
You can keep doing this alone
if you want...

571
00:34:46.809 --> 00:34:50.719
Bunty can't do squat
without his Babli!

572
00:34:50.975 --> 00:34:53.584
Our con works because
you can plan and I can execute.

573
00:34:53.858 --> 00:34:56.416
