575
00:34:58.317 --> 00:34:59.700
How do I know?

576
00:35:13.421 --> 00:35:15.262
Life is funny.

577
00:35:16.476 --> 00:35:19.781
Till a few days back,
this used to be our dream.

578
00:35:20.290 --> 00:35:23.742
A 9 to 5 job at a multinational firm,
suit and tie.

579
00:35:24.487 --> 00:35:28.389
Thank god none of it came true.

580
00:35:31.626 --> 00:35:34.139
Are you still hung up on it?

581
00:35:34.745 --> 00:35:35.473
Nope.

582
00:35:35.836 --> 00:35:37.061
Hi sir.
Hi ma'am.

583
00:35:37.365 --> 00:35:40.525
We are taking signature for child
malnutrition and food wastage.

584
00:35:40.856 --> 00:35:43.527
If you like to join the cause it
will just take a minute of your time.

585
00:35:44.505 --> 00:35:46.551
- Ya sure why not.
- Come with me.

586
00:35:46.783 --> 00:35:47.668
STOP WASTING FOOD.
START FEEDING HUNGRY

587
00:35:47.936 --> 00:35:51.416
So we are an NGO called
Combat Malnutrition.

588
00:35:52.954 --> 00:35:54.578
THEY NEED FOOD AND WATER

589
00:35:58.731 --> 00:36:00.555
FIGHT FOR A HUNGER-FREE INDIA

590
00:36:04.408 --> 00:36:07.699
Pretending to be the PM's scientific
advisors... they robbed the mayor...

591
00:36:07.973 --> 00:36:12.016
promising him to lease out
the river ganga.

592
00:36:12.226 --> 00:36:14.430
Today, on Criminals... Bunty and Babli.

593
00:36:14.715 --> 00:36:18.683
Names that are back
on everyone's lips.

594
00:36:18.912 --> 00:36:22.592
The police are clueless
while the amused public wonders...

595
00:36:22.822 --> 00:36:24.569
...who's going to be their next target?

596
00:36:24.722 --> 00:36:25.443
Mom!

597
00:36:25.654 --> 00:36:29.838
Oh my baby, I'm so sorry!
Are you hurt my Pappu.

598
00:36:31.675 --> 00:36:33.096
