599
00:36:33.639 --> 00:36:34.620
Rinku?

600
00:36:39.399 --> 00:36:43.041
The gravy is delicious Mrs. Babli.

601
00:36:44.775 --> 00:36:46.686
Lemme get to the point.

602
00:36:46.970 --> 00:36:49.370
I don't do stuff myself.

603
00:36:49.808 --> 00:36:51.640
I like getting it done.

604
00:36:52.725 --> 00:36:56.603
Bunty-Babli 2.0 are making
my ulcers bleed.

605
00:36:56.980 --> 00:37:02.657
There's a lot of pressure
to make an arrest.

606
00:37:03.473 --> 00:37:07.785
Be it those guys... or you two.

607
00:37:09.237 --> 00:37:11.164
Like Dashrath Sir once said...

608
00:37:11.440 --> 00:37:15.277
"The world is made of two
kinds of people,

609
00:37:15.609 --> 00:37:20.833
one - those who never break
the law and never go to prison.

610
00:37:21.363 --> 00:37:28.228
And two - those who don't break
the law, and yet end up in prison!"

611
00:37:29.267 --> 00:37:33.429
And if you two don't want
to be the second kind...

612
00:37:33.758 --> 00:37:36.960
...you must help us nab these two.

613
00:37:37.930 --> 00:37:41.500
After all, you two are veterans
of this game.

614
00:37:44.002 --> 00:37:47.319
Sir, we've simple domestic life
for ourselves... We have a child.

615
00:37:47.567 --> 00:37:49.571
How can you expect us
to leave everything...

616
00:37:49.788 --> 00:37:51.809
