631
00:39:03.543 --> 00:39:08.388
We worked hard to build
a brand like "Bunty & Babli"...

632
00:39:09.047 --> 00:39:12.518
...and now a couple of clowns
are destroying it.

633
00:39:12.784 --> 00:39:14.707
And all I do is cook
well done eggs...

634
00:39:14.929 --> 00:39:17.673
...and get pushed around
like petty thieves by night.

635
00:39:19.819 --> 00:39:22.139
Boils my blood too, to be honest.

636
00:39:22.505 --> 00:39:25.098
It feels like someone's pissing
all over our precious work of art...

637
00:39:25.299 --> 00:39:26.821
...and we can't do a thing about it!

638
00:39:26.973 --> 00:39:29.825
We should've got a copyright
on our brand.

639
00:39:31.765 --> 00:39:33.470
Listen up Rakesh.

640
00:39:34.001 --> 00:39:36.025
You need to take a leave from work.

641
00:39:36.294 --> 00:39:38.517
We are the real Bunty-Babli...
not them!

642
00:39:39.179 --> 00:39:42.925
How dare they use our brand...
this is war.

643
00:39:43.292 --> 00:39:47.807
I won't rest till we nab them
and slap them silly.

644
00:39:48.127 --> 00:39:49.822
Attagirl my desi girl!

645
00:39:50.598 --> 00:39:53.886
