712
00:43:32.580 --> 00:43:33.911
A thousand tonnes.

713
00:43:34.166 --> 00:43:35.153
Babli?

714
00:43:36.929 --> 00:43:37.635
Bunty?

715
00:43:38.404 --> 00:43:42.020
Do I look like Babli must be my name?

716
00:43:42.242 --> 00:43:44.352
