- Sorry, sorry.

756
00:46:54.190 --> 00:46:54.690
Hey!

757
00:47:01.941 --> 00:47:02.830
Ouch!

758
00:47:36.201 --> 00:47:39.384
I'll break your bones if I fall,
I'm telling you!

759
00:47:45.395 --> 00:47:46.534
Happy Holi!

760
00:48:06.991 --> 00:48:08.104
Help, help!

761
00:48:10.665 --> 00:48:11.473
Get lost.

762
00:48:13.147 --> 00:48:16.045
You scoundrel... give it to him!

763
00:48:16.257 --> 00:48:18.352
Ms. Wonder Woman!
Eye on the prize!

764
00:48:18.556 --> 00:48:19.598
Okay, okay.

765
00:48:49.948 --> 00:48:53.435
I've got some colours
waiting in jail too.

766
00:48:59.211 --> 00:49:01.462
Look carefully... was it them?

767
00:49:05.838 --> 00:49:07.034
Don't know sir!

768
00:49:07.359 --> 00:49:10.679
The guy I spoke to had
colour all over their face.

769
00:49:10.957 --> 00:49:11.920
What colour was it?

770
00:49:12.127 --> 00:49:16.011
Sea green... Or was it Navy blue?

771
00:49:16.204 --> 00:49:19.855
One tight slap... and you'll sing
like a canary.

772
00:49:20.285 --> 00:49:21.496
Was it them or not?

773
00:49:25.904 --> 00:49:28.614
Sir... actually I had a bit to drink.

774
00:49:29.213 --> 00:49:31.280
I can't remember clearly.

775
00:49:34.265 --> 00:49:37.498
Get lost. Take him.

776
00:49:40.720 --> 00:49:42.187
Get lost.

777
00:49:44.820 --> 00:49:46.818
What were you doing there?

778
00:49:49.013 --> 00:49:50.363
We were just chilling.

779
00:49:50.647 --> 00:49:51.783
Why'd you run?

780
00:50:02.038 --> 00:50:02.830
What's this?

781
00:50:03.705 --> 00:50:04.778
Cannabis sir.

782
00:50:05.123 --> 00:50:05.973
Keep it.

783
00:50:06.679 --> 00:50:09.708
Right in front of us, two boys
were attacked by 7-8 guys...

784
00:50:09.931 --> 00:50:12.122
and then someone started
running towards us!

785
00:50:12.319 --> 00:50:14.097
We panicked, we thought
we did something wrong.

786
00:50:14.300 --> 00:50:15.499
We also started running.

787
00:50:15.749 --> 00:50:17.855
What would you have done
if you were in our place.

788
00:50:18.250 --> 00:50:19.128
Pardon?

789
00:50:20.529 --> 00:50:21.740
Say it in Hindi.

790
00:50:23.298 --> 00:50:25.726
Sir... 8-10 of you attacked two boys.

791
00:50:25.896 --> 00:50:27.458
And then some people
started running towards us...

792
00:50:27.649 --> 00:50:29.259
...we got scared and started
running as well.

793
00:50:29.445 --> 00:50:31.689
What would you have done
if were in our place?

794
00:50:32.145 --> 00:50:34.865
I'll do the questioning, not you.

795
00:50:36.619 --> 00:50:38.496
She's not questioning you sir.

796
00:50:38.744 --> 00:50:41.150
These boys you caught were drunk.

797
00:50:41.416 --> 00:50:43.387
But if she had to question you,
she would ask...

798
00:50:43.625 --> 00:50:47.671
...are you going to arrest us
and present us to the judge...

799
00:50:48.048 --> 00:50:51.485
...because there is no proof...
or charge!

800
00:50:51.638 --> 00:50:54.493
Or are you gonna let us go,
without any more harassment?

801
00:50:54.819 --> 00:50:59.540
Don't teach me about the law... just
because you read a post on Internet!

802
00:50:59.912 --> 00:51:03.166
I don't know about all the laws...
but we do know our rights.

803
00:51:03.359 --> 00:51:05.979
Right or wrong... what if
I just don't let you guys go?

804
00:51:06.208 --> 00:51:08.778
That's up to you.

805
00:51:11.342 --> 00:51:14.902
In exactly 20 minutes,
you'll read a tweet...

806
00:51:15.147 --> 00:51:19.623
...about how 2 engineering grads
were attacked by the police at a fair.

807
00:51:20.961 --> 00:51:23.750
And arrested on fake charges.

808
00:51:23.976 --> 00:51:25.755
About how you detained a woman...

809
00:51:25.948 --> 00:51:28.114
...without the presence
of a single female cop!

810
00:51:28.445 --> 00:51:31.221
The Tweet will tag a number
of news channels,

811
00:51:31.579 --> 00:51:36.174
the Director General of Police
and the honourable Chief Minister!

812
00:51:38.878 --> 00:51:39.734
What's a tweet?

813
00:51:39.954 --> 00:51:41.156
Twitter sir.

814
00:51:41.569 --> 00:51:43.973
They're a like notorious
social media mailmen!

815
00:51:44.231 --> 00:51:46.224
It can make or break governments!

816
00:51:46.536 --> 00:51:49.146
Celebrities, politicians...

817
00:51:49.663 --> 00:51:51.682
...they're are all using it sir!

818
00:51:52.279 --> 00:51:53.561
Could I lose my job?

819
00:51:53.807 --> 00:51:55.932
You'd surely get demoted sir!

820
00:52:02.078 --> 00:52:03.114
Come.

821
00:52:06.087 --> 00:52:07.634
- Thank you sir.
- Thank you uncle.

822
00:52:07.867 --> 00:52:09.500
- Happy holi.
- Happy holi.

823
00:52:10.164 --> 00:52:11.154
Bye, Son.

824
00:52:14.998 --> 00:52:16.270
What're you doing?

825
00:52:16.837 --> 00:52:20.191
Checking on Pappu... Let's not
forget we still have a child.

826
00:52:46.817 --> 00:52:50.594
Street smart, they could sell you
the flag and all its stars

827
00:52:50.825 --> 00:52:54.357
They're a conning Queen and its Czar

828
00:52:54.569 --> 00:52:58.072
From Kanpur to Canada,
they've sold it all, for every price...

829
00:52:58.312 --> 00:53:01.926
Born hustlers, they got
Eskimos buyin all their ice.

830
00:53:19.449 --> 00:53:20.408
- Sir.
- Sir.

831
00:53:21.138 --> 00:53:23.152
How can you let them walk?

832
00:53:23.439 --> 00:53:25.155
This makes no sense!

833
00:53:25.532 --> 00:53:28.916
Bloody wanna-be Sherlocks...

834
00:53:30.070 --> 00:53:33.800
...just because you're working
for the police...

835
00:53:34.028 --> 00:53:37.382
...doesn't give you a license
to rain fire over the whole world.

836
00:53:37.673 --> 00:53:41.702
This isn't a game...
it's a responsibility...

837
00:53:41.976 --> 00:53:44.186
You can't just grab the person
you get hold off.

838
00:53:44.401 --> 00:53:47.342
Next time you better come to me
with solid proof...

839
00:53:49.194 --> 00:53:52.983
...or I'll ship you back
to your oblivious life!

840
00:54:01.626 --> 00:54:03.719
How dare this Jatayu
speak to us like that?!

841
00:54:03.980 --> 00:54:07.076
And why'd you have to go
all P. T. Usha on them?!

842
00:54:07.411 --> 00:54:10.013
You're angry at Jatayu...
don't take it out on me!

843
00:54:10.364 --> 00:54:13.592
Sure... I'll take the blame -
"It's all my fault".

844
00:54:14.273 --> 00:54:15.307
You happy?

845
00:54:28.030 --> 00:54:31.437
I'm sorry Rakesh!

846
00:54:32.442 --> 00:54:37.169
It's the hot-headed
Punjabi girl inside me...

847
00:54:37.358 --> 00:54:42.027
You know, when I caught him...
he was just 6 inches away from me.

848
00:54:42.908 --> 00:54:45.102
I saw Bunty in his eyes!

849
00:54:45.600 --> 00:54:47.995
I can spot a ticketless traveller
inside a crowded train...

850
00:54:48.171 --> 00:54:49.434
...just by look on their face!

851
00:54:49.689 --> 00:54:53.568
I may not know the technology,
but I know people all too well.

852
00:54:53.848 --> 00:54:56.887
I'm dead sure... these two
are the new Bunty and Babli.

853
00:54:57.252 --> 00:55:00.395
And If I'm right, they'll pull off
their next con pretty soon.

854
00:55:00.987 --> 00:55:04.489
Cool. Then we'll catch them
redhanded...

855
00:55:05.031 --> 00:55:09.537
...and prove it to everyone... that
we're still the original tricksters.

856
00:55:10.032 --> 00:55:13.221
They made a big mistake
showing us their faces.

857
00:55:14.316 --> 00:55:15.607
Set it down here.

858
00:55:15.843 --> 00:55:16.664
Make sure you count it.

859
00:55:16.846 --> 00:55:18.783
Don't you worry.

860
00:55:19.148 --> 00:55:20.778
She's counting it.

861
00:55:21.825 --> 00:55:23.621
We're almost done.

862
00:55:23.808 --> 00:55:24.344
Good.

863
00:55:24.593 --> 00:55:27.972
First you got the whole village
cleaned up...

864
00:55:28.295 --> 00:55:30.345
...and now you've brought us
all this food.

865
00:55:30.643 --> 00:55:32.979
Are you from a political party?

866
00:55:34.194 --> 00:55:39.608
We voted for that Mrs. Lovely
thinking we'll see some progress...

867
00:55:39.849 --> 00:55:42.977
...but the only time we see her
all year is when she comes down...

868
00:55:43.222 --> 00:55:46.158
...to collect donations for her
own birthday party!

869
00:55:46.597 --> 00:55:50.483
Thanks a ton my children.
Thank you.

870
00:55:50.847 --> 00:55:51.483
Come!

871
00:55:51.729 --> 00:55:53.687
Mate, this is for you.

872
00:55:56.288 --> 00:55:59.385
But you guys didn't make anything
on this gig.

873
00:55:59.862 --> 00:56:00.853
We did!

874
00:56:01.786 --> 00:56:03.409
In goodwill... and In Karma...

875
00:56:03.792 --> 00:56:05.591
These bags of karma
keep us out of jail...

876
00:56:05.791 --> 00:56:08.469
...if we're out, we can make
all the money we want.

877
00:56:10.725 --> 00:56:13.131
I want in on this karma too!

878
00:56:13.932 --> 00:56:15.053
Love you guys!

879
00:56:15.302 --> 00:56:16.062
Love you.

880
00:56:16.491 --> 00:56:17.407
Love you.

881
00:56:18.914 --> 00:56:20.121
So cute!

882
00:56:23.969 --> 00:56:25.424
That was a close shave this time.

883
00:56:25.717 --> 00:56:27.816
And they know our faces now.

884
00:56:28.223 --> 00:56:30.536
I think we should lie low
for sometime.

885
00:56:30.755 --> 00:56:33.363
Darling, if we lie low now...
they'll know we're definitely guilty.

886
00:56:33.609 --> 00:56:38.663
We need to pull off another con soon...
so we can fund your startup too!

887
00:56:39.280 --> 00:56:41.736
Do you think the Income Tax
department knows...

888
00:56:41.947 --> 00:56:44.299
...about Mrs. Lovely's birthday
donation drive?

889
00:56:44.830 --> 00:56:46.979
Someone needs to tell them!

890
00:56:47.527 --> 00:56:48.252
Okay.

891
00:56:48.632 --> 00:56:50.718
INCOME TAX OFFICE

892
00:56:51.808 --> 00:56:53.310
Mr. Nand Kishore -
Income Tax Officer

893
00:56:55.864 --> 00:56:56.519
Hello.

894
00:56:56.729 --> 00:57:02.357
Am I speaking to the distinguished
Income Tax officer - Mr. Nand Kishore?

895
00:57:02.572 --> 00:57:04.697
You have the right number, go on.

896
00:57:05.159 --> 00:57:08.915
I wanted to give you a tip...
is this line secure?

897
00:57:09.174 --> 00:57:11.557
Safer than a lamb in the jungle!

898
00:57:11.919 --> 00:57:16.501
Sir... Mrs. Lovely... has amassed
donations for her birthday...

899
00:57:16.771 --> 00:57:18.358
...and that too in cash!

900
00:57:18.786 --> 00:57:23.225
I was beaten black and blue
just because I refused to donate.

901
00:57:23.576 --> 00:57:25.864
I've heard you're a messiah
to the poor.

902
00:57:26.397 --> 00:57:29.464
Promise me you'll get her!

903
00:57:29.876 --> 00:57:33.346
Stop crying. I'll see what I can do!

904
00:57:38.246 --> 00:57:43.466
19...18 oh you are doing well...
keep breathing...keep breathing.

905
00:57:44.420 --> 00:57:45.921
Don't speak so much.

906
00:57:46.723 --> 00:57:48.755
Very good, you keep going.

907
00:57:56.453 --> 00:57:58.732
No, no... this way!

908
00:57:58.923 --> 00:58:02.980
With your back arched, or
the lower back takes all the strain...

909
00:58:03.251 --> 00:58:05.844
and then you will just suffer
from back pain.

910
00:58:06.219 --> 00:58:07.423
Correct...correct.

911
00:58:07.837 --> 00:58:09.105
Arch it. Ya?

912
00:58:09.887 --> 00:58:11.809
- Feels better now?
- Yes.

913
00:58:13.237 --> 00:58:14.588
Very better.

914
00:58:20.515 --> 00:58:21.662
You are so funny.

915
00:58:21.855 --> 00:58:23.185
You are also ROFL.

916
00:58:23.579 --> 00:58:24.855
You are also LOL.

917
00:58:31.281 --> 00:58:35.281
Mrs. Lovely will learn what
a Nand Kishore raid feels like!

918
00:58:35.632 --> 00:58:36.953
Where are they going?

919
00:58:37.219 --> 00:58:40.039
They're going raid Mrs. Lovely.
It's gonna be huge.

920
00:58:40.222 --> 00:58:40.788
When?

921
00:58:41.009 --> 00:58:42.256
Tomorrow morning.

922
00:58:48.777 --> 00:58:49.659
What is this?

923
00:58:49.984 --> 00:58:52.635
You let them off the hook,
but we didn't.

924
00:58:53.073 --> 00:58:57.408
That girl has just honey trapped Nand
Kishore - a senior Income Tax officer.

925
00:58:57.871 --> 00:59:01.269
Rakesh has learnt that
Nand Kishore is planning...

926
00:59:01.646 --> 00:59:03.680
...a big raid at Mrs. Lovely's house.

927
00:59:04.073 --> 00:59:09.167
And if she's hovering around him...
then so should we.

928
00:59:18.196 --> 00:59:20.018
Hang on!

929
00:59:21.301 --> 00:59:22.465
Where to?

930
00:59:23.016 --> 00:59:26.686
Your help with the investigation
ends here.

931
00:59:27.314 --> 00:59:30.645
Law enforcement aka
Yours truly... will take it from here.

932
00:59:30.842 --> 00:59:32.818
But we gave you this lead?!

933
00:59:33.059 --> 00:59:34.900
You need us sir.

934
00:59:35.141 --> 00:59:37.832
We know how this Bunty-Babli's
twisted minds work.

935
00:59:38.022 --> 00:59:39.740
I know you do.

936
00:59:40.159 --> 00:59:44.143
Look now that you're both
all decked up.

937
00:59:44.555 --> 00:59:47.542
Why don't you grace this
police station and stay here?

938
00:59:47.746 --> 00:59:49.816
They could do with some entertainment.

939
00:59:50.203 --> 00:59:53.368
While I raid Mrs. Lovely!

940
01:00:19.508 --> 01:00:21.368
Are you in the mood
for some Ice cream?

941
01:00:22.125 --> 01:00:25.099
Only if it's in a waffle cone...
with sprinkles on top.

942
01:00:35.751 --> 01:00:37.026
Mrs. Lovely's

943
01:00:39.730 --> 01:00:42.905
Hurry up...
Seal the place!

944
01:00:43.122 --> 01:00:44.688
Cut the phone lines.
Check every thing.

945
01:00:44.895 --> 01:00:47.698
You guys go upstairs.
Check out those rooms!

946
01:00:47.895 --> 01:00:49.732
Nobody leaves the house!

947
01:00:50.925 --> 01:00:52.786
Where the hell are you guys going?

948
01:00:52.989 --> 01:00:55.722
Stand back, this is a government
operation.

949
01:00:55.946 --> 01:00:56.952
Quick guys!

950
01:00:57.674 --> 01:00:58.210
Hey!

951
01:00:58.759 --> 01:01:00.485
What's this ruckus
early in the morning?

952
01:01:01.019 --> 01:01:03.078
Dhannu, who let these guys in?

953
01:01:03.320 --> 01:01:03.783
They.. Um-

954
01:01:03.965 --> 01:01:05.828
Who are you doofus?
Wait till I get there!

955
01:01:06.651 --> 01:01:08.844
Who the hell are you?!

956
01:01:09.114 --> 01:01:11.246
You census registrars think you
can just walk into anybody's house?

957
01:01:11.415 --> 01:01:12.217
Leave now!

958
01:01:12.420 --> 01:01:15.222
We're not here for the census...
we're here for your black money!

959
01:01:15.793 --> 01:01:16.670
Warrant.

960
01:01:17.398 --> 01:01:18.922
Here's the search warrant!

961
01:01:19.134 --> 01:01:20.021
Get it.

962
01:01:22.077 --> 01:01:22.711
Ma'am.

963
01:01:22.869 --> 01:01:25.573
I'm a politician idiot...
you think I can read! Chop-chop.

964
01:01:25.937 --> 01:01:30.035
It's a government directive. They're
here for the Birthday donations.

965
01:01:32.391 --> 01:01:32.999
INCOME TAX

966
01:01:39.865 --> 01:01:42.910
There goes my birthday party!

967
01:01:43.694 --> 01:01:46.512
Dhannu... I can't breathe Dhannu!

968
01:01:46.916 --> 01:01:48.104
Ma'am...get some air.

969
01:01:53.278 --> 01:01:56.696
Open up! We have a search
warrant for this place!

970
01:01:58.295 --> 01:02:00.876
Who in the lord's name
are Bunty and Babli?!

971
01:02:01.079 --> 01:02:02.054
Bunty Babli?

972
01:02:02.216 --> 01:02:07.596
Yup, The ones who're going to loot
this birthday... I mean public fund.

973
01:02:07.891 --> 01:02:09.054
Hello Pattaya!

974
01:02:09.226 --> 01:02:12.236
It's Jatayu!

975
01:02:12.611 --> 01:02:13.468
Ya, whatever...

976
01:02:13.743 --> 01:02:16.832
A top secret Income Tax raid
is in progress... How can you...?

977
01:02:16.990 --> 01:02:18.680
Hello Mr. Fund Kishore.

978
01:02:18.856 --> 01:02:19.723
It's Nand Kishore.

979
01:02:19.930 --> 01:02:21.102
Whatever...

980
01:02:24.394 --> 01:02:25.413
Are these your guys?

981
01:02:25.590 --> 01:02:26.772
Of course, they are.

982
01:02:27.044 --> 01:02:29.014
Bunty and Babli could've
infiltrated your ranks.

983
01:02:29.498 --> 01:02:30.895
- Gupta...
- Yes sir.

984
01:02:31.104 --> 01:02:32.133
Search all of them.

985
01:02:32.650 --> 01:02:33.863
What the hell?!

986
01:02:37.118 --> 01:02:37.787
Hey!!

987
01:02:39.681 --> 01:02:41.866
They messed with me...
they deserve it!

988
01:02:46.348 --> 01:02:49.787
Why's it so sticky Mr. Officer?
Emptied the whole glue bottle?!

989
01:02:50.053 --> 01:02:52.743
Sir, there's a huge mob
of protestors outside...

990
01:02:52.915 --> 01:02:53.723
What are our orders?

991
01:02:53.920 --> 01:02:56.222
Boss, there's a mob
of 300 plus outside...

992
01:02:56.419 --> 01:02:58.117
...chanting "Down with the Police"!

993
01:02:58.349 --> 01:03:01.512
Finally! Our loyalists
won't spare you guys!

994
01:03:01.773 --> 01:03:03.872
You've ruined our super-secret raid!

995
01:03:04.083 --> 01:03:05.886
Hand me the walkie...

996
01:03:07.721 --> 01:03:08.742
Code red... Code red.

997
01:03:12.959 --> 01:03:13.844
Code red... Code red.

998
01:03:14.084 --> 01:03:15.926
Roger that! We're on our way.

999
01:03:16.183 --> 01:03:17.305
- Quick.
- Yes sir.

1000
01:03:17.773 --> 01:03:18.739
Let's go.

1001
01:03:20.608 --> 01:03:23.831
We were expecting Bunty-Babli...
not the bloody QRT!

1002
01:03:24.132 --> 01:03:25.068
QRT?

1003
01:03:25.285 --> 01:03:26.516
Quick Response Team.

1004
01:03:30.241 --> 01:03:32.113
Sir look at their guns.

1005
01:03:32.314 --> 01:03:34.585
No!! My birthday kitty!

1006
01:03:34.826 --> 01:03:35.639
Ma'am!

1007
01:03:40.540 --> 01:03:43.649
Expect your suspension orders
by the end of the day.

1008
01:03:43.860 --> 01:03:46.183
Piss off Fund Kishor
before I bite that finger off.

1009
01:03:48.349 --> 01:03:51.147
4 birds with a stone, huh?

1010
01:03:51.359 --> 01:03:53.469
More like none in hand,
none in bush!

1011
01:04:01.690 --> 01:04:02.817
Careful there...

1012
01:04:03.616 --> 01:04:05.183
Overtake him.

1013
01:04:06.410 --> 01:04:07.131
Hey...

1014
01:04:07.440 --> 01:04:09.047
Think you own the road bugger?!

1015
01:04:12.468 --> 01:04:14.996
Sir you won't believe
the raid I've pulled off.

1016
01:04:15.474 --> 01:04:18.183
Mrs. Lovely's gonna bleed
tears tonight!

1017
01:04:19.563 --> 01:04:20.577
Just a minute sir!

1018
01:04:22.198 --> 01:04:24.090
Step on the gas buddy!

1019
01:04:24.381 --> 01:04:25.822
Hey, stop the car!

1020
01:04:26.114 --> 01:04:26.749
Stop it.

1021
01:04:27.975 --> 01:04:29.758
Where's the cash?

1022
01:04:30.009 --> 01:04:33.997
Half in this car and the other half
in the QRT truck.

1023
01:04:37.109 --> 01:04:38.418
But where's the damn truck?

1024
01:04:38.606 --> 01:04:40.238
It was right behind all this while.

1025
01:04:40.463 --> 01:04:41.633
So where is it now?!

1026
01:04:50.137 --> 01:04:51.557
Sorry sir.

1027
01:04:52.857 --> 01:04:56.090
We got ambushed by a wedding party,
and someone punctured our tyres.

1028
01:04:56.409 --> 01:04:58.009
Somehow we wrangled this ride.

1029
01:04:58.439 --> 01:05:00.718
Some jackass even stole
my walkie talkie!

1030
01:05:01.499 --> 01:05:02.843
Keep your posture right.

1031
01:05:03.427 --> 01:05:06.315
28... 27.

1032
01:05:06.564 --> 01:05:07.581
Keep looking down.

1033
01:05:08.070 --> 01:05:09.379
26.

1034
01:05:10.206 --> 01:05:11.704
25.

1035
01:05:13.117 --> 01:05:17.004
A unit of the QRT
should be on stand by...

1036
01:05:17.196 --> 01:05:19.087
This village is full
of her loyalists...

1037
01:05:19.322 --> 01:05:21.356
...who will jump in to save her.

1038
01:05:21.587 --> 01:05:23.178
I want 2 walkie-talkies handy.

1039
01:05:23.361 --> 01:05:25.425
Set to a frequency of 2.483 Ghz.

1040
01:05:25.613 --> 01:05:28.790
One with the QRT commander
and the other with me.

1041
01:05:29.003 --> 01:05:30.269
Code red... Code red.

1042
01:05:30.835 --> 01:05:31.722
Code red... Code red.

1043
01:05:31.898 --> 01:05:33.041
Roger that! We're on our way.

1044
01:05:33.199 --> 01:05:33.820
Quick.

1045
01:05:36.657 --> 01:05:37.615
- Cadets!
- Yes Sir!

1046
01:05:38.025 --> 01:05:40.144
Stop staring at the party!
Clear the damn road!

1047
01:05:44.460 --> 01:05:46.233
Please make way...

1048
01:05:47.475 --> 01:05:48.923
Someone stop them!

1049
01:05:51.422 --> 01:05:52.812
Who took my walkie?

1050
01:05:53.255 --> 01:05:55.696
And who the hell punctured the tyre?

1051
01:05:56.927 --> 01:05:58.584
They've got no match,

1052
01:05:58.805 --> 01:06:00.167
they're in the zone

1053
01:06:00.356 --> 01:06:02.081
Across the world,
oh it's well known...

1054
01:06:02.277 --> 01:06:03.934
Bunty & Babli

1055
01:06:04.359 --> 01:06:05.384
Twice the swag,

1056
01:06:05.537 --> 01:06:07.775
and double the cross

1057
01:06:08.168 --> 01:06:09.509
They've got the sauce

1058
01:06:09.749 --> 01:06:11.400
Bunty & Babli!

1059
01:06:16.300 --> 01:06:18.977
Hey... you think you own the road?!

1060
01:06:19.189 --> 01:06:22.537
Of course not darling, it's all yours!
Love you!

1061
01:06:33.598 --> 01:06:34.256
Shit!

1062
01:06:34.691 --> 01:06:35.282
INCOME TAX

1063
01:06:39.613 --> 01:06:40.972
Bunty-Babli!

1064
01:06:42.572 --> 01:06:44.010
What's the final figure?

1065
01:06:44.447 --> 01:06:45.858
2 Billion Rupees!

1066
01:06:48.189 --> 01:06:50.468
Rascals didn't even leave us
loose change!

1067
01:06:50.923 --> 01:06:52.732
Looks like I'm the one
who's gonna bleed tears!

1068
01:06:53.207 --> 01:06:54.800
They've got no match,

1069
01:06:55.057 --> 01:06:56.411
they're in the zone

1070
01:06:56.614 --> 01:06:58.308
Across the world,
oh it's well known...

1071
01:06:58.513 --> 01:07:00.126
Bunty & Babli

1072
01:07:00.607 --> 01:07:01.685
Twice the swag,

1073
01:07:01.845 --> 01:07:03.947
and double the cross

1074
01:07:04.441 --> 01:07:05.826
They've got the sauce

1075
01:07:06.038 --> 01:07:07.812
Bunty & Babli

1076
01:07:14.257 --> 01:07:17.503
- Dude it's past the expiry date.
- Sorry sir.

1077
01:07:17.774 --> 01:07:19.622
I've never been humiliated
like this before.

1078
01:07:19.912 --> 01:07:22.498
Maybe I should just resign
before they suspend me...

1079
01:07:22.683 --> 01:07:25.041
...and go back to herding goats.

1080
01:07:25.316 --> 01:07:26.289
Private Number

1081
01:07:29.882 --> 01:07:30.547
Hello!

1082
01:07:30.775 --> 01:07:31.495
Hello sir!

1083
01:07:31.760 --> 01:07:32.462
Who's this?

1084
01:07:32.931 --> 01:07:36.280
The ones you're hunting
for everywhere.

1085
01:07:38.403 --> 01:07:40.378
Bunty and Babli!

1086
01:07:42.039 --> 01:07:43.567
We just called to apologize sir.

1087
01:07:43.935 --> 01:07:46.600
All we wanted was to take
advantage of the mob.

1088
01:07:46.940 --> 01:07:49.109
So we could flick all the cash as QRT!

1089
01:07:49.493 --> 01:07:52.467
We had no idea, you were
gonna join the party.

1090
01:07:52.807 --> 01:07:54.326
But don't worry, Sir.

1091
01:07:54.696 --> 01:07:57.168
Nand Kishore has taken full
responsibility for the entire fiasco.

1092
01:07:57.502 --> 01:07:59.245
I don't care for your apology.

1093
01:07:59.531 --> 01:08:01.610
Take my advice... turn yourselves in.

1094
01:08:01.881 --> 01:08:05.807
Or I'm gonna put you away
for so long...

1095
01:08:06.059 --> 01:08:07.931
...that both of you will be
the last of your name!

1096
01:08:08.232 --> 01:08:11.195
Do you know why we chose
the names Bunty & Babli?

1097
01:08:11.566 --> 01:08:14.789
Because they're the only famous con
artists, who've never been caught.

1098
01:08:17.247 --> 01:08:20.196
And neither will we be.
So forget about it sir...

1099
01:08:20.586 --> 01:08:22.714
...and sleep tight.

1100
01:08:36.135 --> 01:08:39.756
Mr. Bunty... Mrs. Babli...

1101
01:08:41.838 --> 01:08:44.793
These two amateurs
just schooled you two!

1102
01:08:45.297 --> 01:08:48.216
And they almost got me rusticated!

1103
01:08:48.463 --> 01:08:49.978
Maybe, if you had taken us along...

1104
01:08:50.204 --> 01:08:52.302
Like that would've made a difference!

1105
01:08:54.109 --> 01:08:59.140
I was wrong to think you guys
are cut out for this.

1106
01:09:00.578 --> 01:09:05.607
Gift wrap your little Pappu and go
back to your shitty small town life.

1107
01:09:06.099 --> 01:09:10.719
You gentleman, go back
to checking tickets.

1108
01:09:11.226 --> 01:09:14.699
And you ladies, go back to do
whatever you were doing.

1109
01:09:15.482 --> 01:09:18.961
You guys are way past your prime...

1110
01:09:19.962 --> 01:09:24.380
...you're like an Aspirin that gives
a headache... instead of curing one!

1111
01:09:27.112 --> 01:09:28.613
- Let's go.
- Ok.

1112
01:09:30.137 --> 01:09:36.695
Sir, I know you're still 0 for 4,
but that was too harsh?

1113
01:09:36.937 --> 01:09:38.870
I mean, what did they do wrong?

1114
01:09:39.165 --> 01:09:41.481
They were only leading
their family lives in-

1115
01:09:41.690 --> 01:09:43.273
Gupta...

1116
01:09:44.461 --> 01:09:50.908
An old horse has to be flogged now and
then if you want it to win the race.

1117
01:09:52.269 --> 01:09:54.050
They're Bunty-Babli for god's sake!

1118
01:09:54.290 --> 01:09:57.683
No one can even dream of the scams
they've pulled off in their heydays.

1119
01:09:58.088 --> 01:09:59.927
Once they put their minds to it...

1120
01:10:00.121 --> 01:10:03.382
...they can take on anybody,
let alone these two upstarts.

1121
01:10:04.381 --> 01:10:07.678
Till now they were doing
this out of compulsion...

1122
01:10:08.027 --> 01:10:11.902
...now I've made it personal for them.

1123
01:10:13.378 --> 01:10:17.245
As far as the score goes...
I still get my 4 birds.

1124
01:10:17.510 --> 01:10:19.914
You have my best wishes, sir.

1125
01:10:30.485 --> 01:10:34.665
We couldn't salvage an inch of
respect... let alone saving our brand.

1126
01:10:35.946 --> 01:10:37.865
Enough is enough Rakesh...

1127
01:10:38.262 --> 01:10:43.152
Like they say in English...
we need to "Up our game"!

1128
01:10:44.566 --> 01:10:49.492
Vimmi, the world is made up
of two kinds of people...

1129
01:10:49.770 --> 01:10:53.085
One - the ones who are mere spectators,
happy to just clap & cheer...

1130
01:10:53.291 --> 01:10:58.342
And two... those who not only play...
but also change the rules of the game!

1131
01:10:58.723 --> 01:11:04.117
We need to stop being the 1st kind...
and become the 2nd kind.

1132
01:11:04.640 --> 01:11:06.758
We need to change the game...

1133
01:11:07.110 --> 01:11:09.972
...and turn these two into spectators!

1134
01:11:10.405 --> 01:11:13.835
Make them dance to our tunes.

1135
01:11:14.407 --> 01:11:17.658
The original Bunty and Babli
is coming back!

1136
01:11:18.829 --> 01:11:19.716
Cheers.

1137
01:11:39.989 --> 01:11:42.945
Have you ever seen this much money?

1138
01:11:43.321 --> 01:11:45.235
Not even in my dreams!

1139
01:11:46.818 --> 01:11:49.769
Man, it's making my head spin...

1140
01:11:53.444 --> 01:11:58.614
Rakesh, they've only ever stolen
from thieves?

1141
01:11:59.115 --> 01:12:01.144
Their conscience must be clean.

1142
01:12:01.322 --> 01:12:03.854
True, but I'm sure they're having
a hard time believing...

1143
01:12:04.010 --> 01:12:05.365
...all that money is theirs...

1144
01:12:07.335 --> 01:12:10.881
And when you lose belief, it starts
playing games with your mind!

1145
01:12:11.253 --> 01:12:12.287
It's over!

1146
01:12:12.579 --> 01:12:14.210
It's time to bid farewell
to Bunty and Babli.

1147
01:12:14.423 --> 01:12:16.060
We need a clean slate!

1148
01:12:16.567 --> 01:12:17.523
What do you mean?

1149
01:12:17.776 --> 01:12:21.465
We can fund my startup
with this money...

1150
01:12:21.707 --> 01:12:24.646
...and still have enough for money
for generations to come!

1151
01:12:25.114 --> 01:12:28.526
I read somewhere... there is always
a right time to exit a con!

1152
01:12:29.003 --> 01:12:30.899
This is our 'right time'...

1153
01:12:31.489 --> 01:12:32.865
It's a neat idea...

1154
01:12:33.598 --> 01:12:35.232
...but there's a problem.

1155
01:12:35.614 --> 01:12:42.572
We need a plan that makes them come
straight to us with their bags of cash!

1156
01:12:42.836 --> 01:12:45.456
Only then will Inspector Jatayu
will believe us.

1157
01:12:45.838 --> 01:12:51.245
If we had all that money... what would
be going on in our heads right now?

1158
01:12:51.435 --> 01:12:54.011
Cash payments above
200,000 are monitored...

1159
01:12:54.201 --> 01:12:56.166
...anonymous deposits
are virtually impossible.

1160
01:12:56.461 --> 01:13:00.471
And buying a car or property, etc.
could tip off the Income Tax guys.

1161
01:13:00.897 --> 01:13:02.309
Then let's put the money in this app?

1162
01:13:02.526 --> 01:13:03.946
But how we gonna fund it babe?

1163
01:13:04.111 --> 01:13:06.321
Hire people... pay salaries, etc?

1164
01:13:06.761 --> 01:13:09.204
Paying in cash is a huge risk.

1165
01:13:09.664 --> 01:13:18.691
They'll have to launder this money to
be able to use it from a bank account.

1166
01:13:18.892 --> 01:13:19.930
I got an idea!

1167
01:13:20.220 --> 01:13:22.111
An old school con...

1168
01:13:22.723 --> 01:13:26.490
They're good at playing
this sophisticated game...

1169
01:13:26.864 --> 01:13:30.015
if we have to catch them, we need
to bring them down to our level!

1170
01:13:30.877 --> 01:13:33.028
How are we going to launder
all of this money?

1171
01:13:33.419 --> 01:13:35.474
There's got to be a way.

1172
01:13:36.011 --> 01:13:38.540
Let's put this money away
for the time being...

1173
01:13:38.778 --> 01:13:40.970
...and take a nice, long holiday.

1174
01:13:41.318 --> 01:13:44.169
We can find a solution
after we come back.

1175
01:13:49.421 --> 01:13:50.374
Now?

1176
01:13:51.824 --> 01:13:55.311
You're not going to lose flab
in one day!

1177
01:13:55.659 --> 01:13:57.271
Have this protein shake.

1178
01:14:02.266 --> 01:14:06.674
This flab is a gift of the happy and
peaceful married life you've given me!

1179
01:14:07.920 --> 01:14:11.943
Wait till you see the original Bunty.

1180
01:14:12.783 --> 01:14:16.383
They're not gonna know what hit them.

1181
01:14:25.797 --> 01:14:29.533
That is a fine piece of work!

1182
01:14:29.734 --> 01:14:30.445
Damn right.

1183
01:14:33.601 --> 01:14:34.623
Now let's party!

1184
01:14:37.262 --> 01:14:38.158
Oh yeah.

1185
01:14:40.798 --> 01:14:41.446
Love you!

1186
01:15:00.341 --> 01:15:01.645
Two lonely hearts.

1187
01:15:01.886 --> 01:15:03.216
Footlose and free.

1188
01:15:03.405 --> 01:15:04.576
Let's go on a spree.

1189
01:15:04.834 --> 01:15:06.349
Gotta do it now, anyhow!

1190
01:15:15.852 --> 01:15:17.120
My heart's a tinderbox.

1191
01:15:17.364 --> 01:15:18.741
Your mind... the matchbox.

1192
01:15:18.996 --> 01:15:20.116
Abuzz... ablaze and carefree.

1193
01:15:20.300 --> 01:15:21.837
Gotta make it now, anyhow!

1194
01:15:27.498 --> 01:15:30.423
So hold me tight.

1195
01:15:30.742 --> 01:15:33.524
We only got tonight.

1196
01:15:34.223 --> 01:15:36.927
All I wanna do, my baby blue...

1197
01:15:37.315 --> 01:15:39.801
is coochie coo. With you.

1198
01:15:40.042 --> 01:15:42.671
Love you... love you.

1199
01:15:42.981 --> 01:15:44.944
My heart's the field of gold.

1200
01:15:45.111 --> 01:15:46.092
You're the farmer too.

1201
01:15:46.259 --> 01:15:49.045
Love you... love you.

1202
01:15:49.351 --> 01:15:50.745
Imma spend every dime...

1203
01:15:50.916 --> 01:15:52.295
every Saturday on you.

1204
01:15:52.472 --> 01:15:55.054
Love you... love you.

1205
01:15:55.309 --> 01:15:57.007
I wanna be the gloss...

1206
01:15:57.183 --> 01:15:58.443
on your lips... girl, it's true!

1207
01:15:58.629 --> 01:16:01.277
Love you... love you.

1208
01:16:01.555 --> 01:16:03.133
I wanna be the house.

1209
01:16:03.304 --> 01:16:05.082
You come runnin home to!

1210
01:16:11.498 --> 01:16:12.489
GURDWARA. GURU NANAK DARBAR

1211
01:16:14.676 --> 01:16:16.089
Greetings uncle!

1212
01:16:16.289 --> 01:16:17.211
Greetings.

1213
01:16:18.745 --> 01:16:21.839
You two... after all these years.

1214
01:16:22.508 --> 01:16:23.828
Everything alright?

1215
01:16:24.081 --> 01:16:25.029
Yes.

1216
01:16:25.881 --> 01:16:26.907
CHANGEZI RESTAURANT

1217
01:16:28.387 --> 01:16:29.730
Hey, Senor Mehmood!

1218
01:16:32.782 --> 01:16:34.478
Bunty-Babli!

1219
01:16:35.316 --> 01:16:36.791
You guys are all over the news!

1220
01:16:37.255 --> 01:16:38.583
Where you been all this time?

1221
01:16:39.044 --> 01:16:40.806
Good look, huh.

1222
01:16:46.114 --> 01:16:47.568
- This is empty.
- This one too.

1223
01:16:47.776 --> 01:16:48.777
Only for now.

1224
01:16:49.053 --> 01:16:54.137
Just imagine our cut for helping the
government find its 2 Billion rupees!

1225
01:16:54.471 --> 01:16:58.147
So much cash it'll pop out
of these zips!

1226
01:17:06.464 --> 01:17:07.927
I got you and you got me.

1227
01:17:08.093 --> 01:17:09.450
This ain't a game for three.

1228
01:17:09.630 --> 01:17:10.815
Yo paparazzi! Just let us be.

1229
01:17:10.986 --> 01:17:12.690
Gotta do it now, Anyhow!

1230
01:17:18.915 --> 01:17:20.243
World ain't worth a dirty dime.

1231
01:17:20.433 --> 01:17:21.864
It's got no reason, or no rhyme.

1232
01:17:22.044 --> 01:17:23.150
But don't you ever be cross with me.

1233
01:17:23.327 --> 01:17:25.132
Gonna make it now, Anyhow!

1234
01:17:30.529 --> 01:17:33.325
Sing a song with me, swe-pea...

1235
01:17:33.773 --> 01:17:36.275
on Youtube... for everyone to see.

1236
01:17:37.250 --> 01:17:39.921
All I wanna do, my baby blue...

1237
01:17:40.315 --> 01:17:42.533
is coochie coo. With you.

1238
01:17:43.237 --> 01:17:45.778
Love you... love you.

1239
01:17:45.986 --> 01:17:47.944
My heart's the field of gold.

1240
01:17:48.158 --> 01:17:49.117
You're the farmer too.

1241
01:17:49.318 --> 01:17:51.995
Love you... love you.

1242
01:17:52.355 --> 01:17:53.793
Imma spend every dime...

1243
01:17:53.961 --> 01:17:55.320
every Saturday on you.

1244
01:17:55.505 --> 01:17:57.998
Love you... love you.

1245
01:17:58.421 --> 01:17:59.955
I wanna be the gloss...

1246
01:18:00.167 --> 01:18:01.513
on your lips... girl, it's true!

1247
01:18:01.764 --> 01:18:04.079
Love you... love you.

1248
01:18:04.558 --> 01:18:06.146
I wanna be the house.

1249
01:18:06.313 --> 01:18:07.987
You come runnin home to!

1250
01:18:14.478 --> 01:18:15.585
POKER CLUB

1251
01:18:16.005 --> 01:18:19.667
Look Pappu...
all your favourite things!

1252
01:18:20.177 --> 01:18:22.822
Burger, French fries, Chowmein...

1253
01:18:23.338 --> 01:18:25.551
and your lemonade!

1254
01:18:26.742 --> 01:18:28.001
What do you want mom?

1255
01:18:29.803 --> 01:18:32.766
I've heard you can find anyone
on the web...

1256
01:18:33.652 --> 01:18:35.275
Can you find them?

1257
01:18:41.538 --> 01:18:43.665
Don't need no candle light.

1258
01:18:43.864 --> 01:18:45.248
I'll light up that moon for you.

1259
01:18:45.448 --> 01:18:48.341
On my rooftop, I wanna hear you.

1260
01:18:48.541 --> 01:18:52.499
Sayin... I Love you.

1261
01:18:57.396 --> 01:19:00.716
Don't be shy, my baby blue.

1262
01:19:00.929 --> 01:19:03.044
lemme hear you...

1263
01:19:03.257 --> 01:19:05.340
say... love you. My baby blue.

1264
01:19:06.113 --> 01:19:08.669
I love you. My baby blue.

1265
01:19:09.571 --> 01:19:10.450
Say it.

1266
01:19:11.144 --> 01:19:12.005
Sing it.

1267
01:19:12.672 --> 01:19:15.173
My name... I just wanna.

1268
01:19:15.984 --> 01:19:18.669
Hear you say.

1269
01:19:19.470 --> 01:19:22.229
All I wanna do, my baby blue...

1270
01:19:22.488 --> 01:19:24.692
is coochie coo. With you.

1271
01:19:25.293 --> 01:19:27.964
Love you... love you.

1272
01:19:28.218 --> 01:19:30.162
My heart's the field of gold.

1273
01:19:30.334 --> 01:19:31.366
You're the farmer too.

1274
01:19:31.518 --> 01:19:34.305
Love you... love you.

1275
01:19:34.588 --> 01:19:35.990
Imma spend every dime...

1276
01:19:36.154 --> 01:19:37.457
every Saturday on you.

1277
01:19:37.639 --> 01:19:39.865
Love you... love you.

1278
01:19:40.557 --> 01:19:42.169
I wanna be the gloss...

1279
01:19:42.377 --> 01:19:43.749
on your lips... girl, it's true!

1280
01:19:44.023 --> 01:19:46.260
Love you... love you.

1281
01:19:46.790 --> 01:19:48.192
I wanna be the house.

1282
01:19:48.428 --> 01:19:49.697
You come runnin home to!

1283
01:19:56.154 --> 01:19:57.587
Love you.

1284
01:20:05.957 --> 01:20:08.823
Resort done... Beach done...
Church done...

1285
01:20:09.555 --> 01:20:10.925
Let's go to that lighthouse!

1286
01:20:14.147 --> 01:20:15.302
Uncle, are you crazy?

1287
01:20:15.625 --> 01:20:16.658
Oh my God!

1288
01:20:17.721 --> 01:20:18.606
Oh my God!

1289
01:20:19.254 --> 01:20:20.793
I am sorry... so sorry.

1290
01:20:21.071 --> 01:20:21.862
I'm scared.

1291
01:20:22.158 --> 01:20:25.426
I need to get somewhere urgently
and my car broke down!

1292
01:20:25.642 --> 01:20:27.400
So you'll just stand
in the middle of the road?

1293
01:20:27.605 --> 01:20:28.456
Baby calm down.

1294
01:20:28.624 --> 01:20:31.208
Sorry, please I need a lift...
it's close by.

1295
01:20:31.629 --> 01:20:34.542
I am Briganza, how do you do?

1296
01:20:35.098 --> 01:20:37.256
Hello ma'am! hello!
Please help me?

1297
01:20:37.530 --> 01:20:39.589
Please, please help...

1298
01:20:40.000 --> 01:20:42.348
Thank you.

1299
01:20:43.406 --> 01:20:44.519
Dear Lord!

1300
01:20:46.830 --> 01:20:48.757
Sorry, sorry.

1301
01:20:50.304 --> 01:20:53.132
Just a sec... Lemme get that!

1302
01:20:55.359 --> 01:20:55.962
I'm done.

1303
01:20:57.432 --> 01:20:59.059
I'm sorry. Relax.

1304
01:21:05.684 --> 01:21:07.134
Over to you Uncle.

1305
01:21:12.586 --> 01:21:14.407
EMPIRE PRINTING PRESS

1306
01:21:22.555 --> 01:21:23.613
Yes, yes!

1307
01:21:24.350 --> 01:21:25.231
Where's he going?

1308
01:21:25.965 --> 01:21:27.794
Thank you!

1309
01:21:32.350 --> 01:21:33.876
Strange place, no?

1310
01:21:35.305 --> 01:21:37.472
And an even stranger man...

1311
01:21:37.868 --> 01:21:41.388
That's coz he's carrying
a bag full of cash...

1312
01:21:41.764 --> 01:21:43.337
- Cash?
- Cash.

1313
01:21:47.008 --> 01:21:48.206
Greetings, Uncle.

1314
01:21:48.539 --> 01:21:49.639
Greetings, my son.

1315
01:21:55.596 --> 01:21:56.978
Hand it over.

1316
01:22:08.669 --> 01:22:11.213
The plot thickens!

1317
01:22:12.331 --> 01:22:13.322
Thank you.

1318
01:22:14.238 --> 01:22:15.603
He's here.

1319
01:22:19.387 --> 01:22:22.674
Oh my God!
What happened to the car?

1320
01:22:22.964 --> 01:22:24.871
The tyre's punctured...
Won't be too long.

1321
01:22:25.056 --> 01:22:30.701
I'm so sorry to have caused
so much trouble to you guys.

1322
01:22:30.936 --> 01:22:33.031
Nothing like that!
Just some car trouble...

1323
01:22:33.262 --> 01:22:37.391
I'm not letting you two leave
without a drink... I'm buying, I insist.

1324
01:22:37.566 --> 01:22:39.265
No sir, we're very tired.

1325
01:22:39.463 --> 01:22:42.071
You guys helped me out in a jam.

1326
01:22:42.539 --> 01:22:45.767
How can I leave you high and dry?
C'mon, I insist.

1327
01:22:46.643 --> 01:22:52.058
You guys wouldn't have helped me
if I wasn't acting that crazy!

1328
01:22:52.613 --> 01:22:55.459
- Sir.
- Come on.

1329
01:22:56.042 --> 01:22:58.756
I was meeting someone to launder
my money... abroad.

1330
01:23:02.272 --> 01:23:07.810
But isn't that risky to send
all that money out of the country?

1331
01:23:08.074 --> 01:23:11.744
Black money goes out...
and white money comes back in.

1332
01:23:13.116 --> 01:23:15.055
India's money should stay in India!
So nice thing, no?

1333
01:23:15.235 --> 01:23:17.222
I knew you could send
your money out...

1334
01:23:17.425 --> 01:23:20.198
...but bringing it back in,
doesn't sound right to me?

1335
01:23:21.089 --> 01:23:22.174
Lemme explain.

1336
01:23:22.705 --> 01:23:26.404
I get a 10 rupee note in exchange
for the cash I deposit here.

1337
01:23:26.739 --> 01:23:28.787
The number on this note is the code...

1338
01:23:29.127 --> 01:23:33.286
...which my man abroad will show
to collect the money.

1339
01:23:33.686 --> 01:23:37.587
The money laundering laws in these
tax havens are pretty lenient.

1340
01:23:37.956 --> 01:23:39.707
All you need a bank employee...

1341
01:23:39.968 --> 01:23:42.265
...who'll let you deposit this money
in your bank account!

1342
01:23:42.455 --> 01:23:43.366
COLOSSAL BANK LLP

1343
01:23:45.827 --> 01:23:47.358
What if we want to use this service?

1344
01:23:49.625 --> 01:23:58.697
This is a super secret network,
run by a dangerous man called Bhuller.

1345
01:23:59.221 --> 01:24:02.040
You need a code to become
a part of this network.

1346
01:24:02.363 --> 01:24:04.480
- Sir there must be some way.
- Yes sir, please!

1347
01:24:04.872 --> 01:24:06.187
Take the phone number.

1348
01:24:06.793 --> 01:24:08.018
They'll ask you for a code...

1349
01:24:08.484 --> 01:24:09.799
but you wont have one!

1350
01:24:11.250 --> 01:24:14.038
No worries. You can try.

1351
01:24:14.434 --> 01:24:16.073
INTERNET CALLING

1352
01:24:16.778 --> 01:24:17.889
It's ringing.

1353
01:24:20.209 --> 01:24:20.650
Hello.

1354
01:24:20.944 --> 01:24:22.756
Code and password?

1355
01:24:23.231 --> 01:24:25.653
Actually, I don't have one
but I was hoping that...

1356
01:24:26.916 --> 01:24:30.139
They cut it. Let's try again.

1357
01:24:30.661 --> 01:24:31.567
INTERNET CALLING

1358
01:24:35.317 --> 01:24:36.930
Code and password...

1359
01:24:37.335 --> 01:24:40.713
I don't have a code... But I've cash
more than what Bhuller can handle.

1360
01:24:42.709 --> 01:24:43.441
Drat!

1361
01:24:48.736 --> 01:24:51.007
Let's talk to the printing press uncle.

1362
01:24:54.125 --> 01:24:54.805
Hello.

1363
01:24:55.185 --> 01:24:56.713
Kill it, uncle!

1364
01:24:56.903 --> 01:24:59.459
Yes, alright... No problem.

1365
01:25:41.956 --> 01:25:44.439
How much longer do we follow him?

1366
01:25:45.011 --> 01:25:47.896
Let's see where the old man is going.

1367
01:25:53.697 --> 01:25:56.523
You've been following me
for the last 3 hours now...

1368
01:25:57.109 --> 01:25:59.095
...what do you want my child?

1369
01:26:08.016 --> 01:26:09.416
God is great.

1370
01:26:13.203 --> 01:26:17.675
I'm just a courier my child...

1371
01:26:18.123 --> 01:26:22.233
I hide their cash in wedding cards
and smuggle it into Delhi...

1372
01:26:23.281 --> 01:26:26.647
I don't know what happens
to the money after that.

1373
01:26:27.489 --> 01:26:31.033
It's not that easy to meet Mr. Bhuller.

1374
01:26:31.573 --> 01:26:34.089
Nothing comes easy
in the world does it?

1375
01:26:34.491 --> 01:26:37.978
But things can be made easier
by paying the right price.

1376
01:26:38.706 --> 01:26:40.037
What's your price?

1377
01:26:45.002 --> 01:26:46.556
2 million!

1378
01:26:49.539 --> 01:26:54.230
Sigh... you'll go back home tomorrow.

1379
01:26:54.462 --> 01:26:57.122
I couldn't even take you out
for a film or shopping!

1380
01:26:57.412 --> 01:26:59.930
Like you could afford
to take me out shopping?!

1381
01:27:00.150 --> 01:27:02.427
My pocket money is way more than yours!

1382
01:27:02.608 --> 01:27:03.490
Is it?

1383
01:27:14.619 --> 01:27:15.747
Is that good enough for you?

1384
01:27:16.011 --> 01:27:17.597
I won it at online poker.

1385
01:27:17.844 --> 01:27:18.629
Wow.

1386
01:27:21.533 --> 01:27:25.189
What if it's you Mom? I can already
see her shoe flying at me!

1387
01:27:35.708 --> 01:27:36.834
You want sugar?

1388
01:27:38.635 --> 01:27:41.669
No sweety... I'm diabetic.

1389
01:27:41.958 --> 01:27:44.640
Rinku, I'll see you later.

1390
01:27:46.063 --> 01:27:47.429
- Bye, bye.
- Bye.

1391
01:27:47.675 --> 01:27:49.362
- Bye, bye.
- Bye, bye.

1392
01:28:01.600 --> 01:28:02.716
Where are they?

1393
01:28:03.043 --> 01:28:04.645
Mom and dad?

1394
01:28:04.959 --> 01:28:09.258
I won't be looking for Nirav Modi
in your godforsaken town, would I?

1395
01:28:09.497 --> 01:28:14.223
I'll tell you...
but what do I get in return?

1396
01:28:14.740 --> 01:28:15.883
Name your price.

1397
01:28:16.120 --> 01:28:20.707
Dad's promised me a mountain bike
if I score 90% in my exams.

1398
01:28:21.005 --> 01:28:21.740
So?

1399
01:28:22.048 --> 01:28:25.301
The thing is he can only get me
a bicycle.

1400
01:28:25.996 --> 01:28:26.515
Right?

1401
01:28:26.691 --> 01:28:28.400
But I want a motorbike!

1402
01:28:29.259 --> 01:28:31.981
I even have the extra
50,000 to buy it...

1403
01:28:32.821 --> 01:28:38.350
But I'm not really gonna score 90%...

1404
01:28:39.871 --> 01:28:43.144
...unless I get question
papers beforehand.

1405
01:28:43.631 --> 01:28:47.566
And a cop can make
that happen easily, right?

1406
01:28:48.348 --> 01:28:50.431
Think about it, no pressure.

1407
01:28:50.756 --> 01:28:56.547
I'm thinking I'm gonna give
your parents a standing ovation...

1408
01:28:56.931 --> 01:29:00.362
...for the great achievement
of raising a talent like you!

1409
01:29:00.671 --> 01:29:01.191
Correct.

1410
01:29:02.445 --> 01:29:04.425
- So it's a deal?
- Come here.

1411
01:29:06.367 --> 01:29:07.286
Deal.

1412
01:29:07.570 --> 01:29:08.653
Listen carefully.

1413
01:29:08.873 --> 01:29:13.632
You need to report everything
you hear, to me.

1414
01:29:14.552 --> 01:29:20.135
You're now a special agent
of the police - Agent 007 Pappu!

1415
01:29:20.520 --> 01:29:24.454
Agent 007 Pappu!

1416
01:29:25.134 --> 01:29:29.903
Snap out of it...
where are your parents?

1417
01:29:30.608 --> 01:29:33.457
- Sir, Abu Dhabi!
- Abu Dhabi!

1418
01:29:53.195 --> 01:29:54.599
Bhuller-Bhuller...

1419
01:29:54.977 --> 01:29:56.967
This is Bobby Bhuller...
you know my game

1420
01:29:57.137 --> 01:29:59.847
India to Abu Dhabi,
they know my name

1421
01:30:00.050 --> 01:30:01.310
Man I am dripping with gold

1422
01:30:01.499 --> 01:30:02.881
My veins got ice,

1423
01:30:03.082 --> 01:30:04.291
but I'm hot and never nice

1424
01:30:04.439 --> 01:30:05.691
Remember my name

1425
01:30:05.861 --> 01:30:08.385
I'm the bank, I am the cash store

1426
01:30:08.618 --> 01:30:09.976
When I rain, it always pours!

1427
01:30:10.156 --> 01:30:11.504
I delete all my foes

1428
01:30:11.900 --> 01:30:13.913
Bhuller keeps changing his location.

1429
01:30:14.478 --> 01:30:16.336
I've heard he's in Abu Dhabi
these days...

1430
01:30:16.597 --> 01:30:19.453
...at the Emirates Palace Hotel,
where he conducts his meetings...

1431
01:30:19.731 --> 01:30:23.846
...and then lunch with French
champagne and Beluga Caviar.

1432
01:30:24.154 --> 01:30:27.454
Sorry sir! Someone ordered
all our Beluga caviar.

1433
01:30:32.009 --> 01:30:33.118
Someone.

1434
01:30:34.853 --> 01:30:36.353
- Who?
- Them.

1435
01:30:48.981 --> 01:30:51.215
Baby, he's coming this way.

1436
01:30:51.411 --> 01:30:52.729
Start eating the caviar...

1437
01:30:53.038 --> 01:30:53.846
What's the point?

1438
01:30:54.071 --> 01:30:55.900
Let's just tell him we want
to launder our money?

1439
01:30:56.103 --> 01:31:00.557
He is the Pablo Escobar of this place
and we need to get his attention!

1440
01:31:00.943 --> 01:31:03.864
I want everything,
the food is delicious.

1441
01:31:04.141 --> 01:31:04.914
It's lovely.

1442
01:31:05.118 --> 01:31:07.061
The chef is good...
I want to give him something.

1443
01:31:08.103 --> 01:31:09.095
Indian?

1444
01:31:10.318 --> 01:31:14.445
No, I am Emirati. My girlfriend,
she Indian. Any problem?

1445
01:31:14.933 --> 01:31:17.106
Jasmine. You can call me J.

1446
01:31:20.859 --> 01:31:22.570
I've heard you are starving.

1447
01:31:23.709 --> 01:31:24.570
Pardon?

1448
01:31:24.807 --> 01:31:26.511
That caviar belongs to me.

1449
01:31:27.146 --> 01:31:28.159
This one?

1450
01:31:28.423 --> 01:31:32.715
Well right now it is on our table
so it belongs to the table.

1451
01:31:33.665 --> 01:31:36.045
You can join us if you want...
we don't mind.

1452
01:31:39.169 --> 01:31:40.173
Oops.

1453
01:31:41.199 --> 01:31:44.376
Ye, what the fish... I am telling you
this man is a crazy!

1454
01:31:44.573 --> 01:31:46.742
This caviar cost 20 thousand Dirhams.

1455
01:31:46.941 --> 01:31:48.143
It's ok baby... it's fine.

1456
01:31:48.357 --> 01:31:50.097
Ok... I don't want to fight...
I don't want to fight.

1457
01:31:50.291 --> 01:31:51.270
Baby calm me down.

1458
01:31:51.488 --> 01:31:53.607
Take my hand, calm me down.
Calm me down.

1459
01:31:53.788 --> 01:31:58.676
No fight, no fight you are guest
in my country so I'll behave.

1460
01:32:01.232 --> 01:32:03.024
You better calm down...

1461
01:32:03.351 --> 01:32:07.547
...because no one can take
what belongs to Bhuller.

1462
01:32:07.903 --> 01:32:09.356
Be it Bhuller's cash...

1463
01:32:12.287 --> 01:32:14.035
...or Bhuller's caviar!

1464
01:32:14.828 --> 01:32:17.252
Waiter, put that on my tab.

1465
01:32:22.791 --> 01:32:24.581
Man, is this guy hot headed or what?!

1466
01:32:24.726 --> 01:32:26.918
Don't break character...
he could turn around.

1467
01:32:29.955 --> 01:32:31.373
Seems I did great!

1468
01:32:35.289 --> 01:32:37.858
I'm the girl in your dream,
I'm the queen

1469
01:32:38.176 --> 01:32:40.843
We're inseparable...
no one gets in between

1470
01:32:41.111 --> 01:32:44.226
A bit of Bubbly - an expert con
and a beauty

1471
01:32:44.479 --> 01:32:47.366
She plays dirty,
cause her name is Cutie!

1472
01:32:47.648 --> 01:32:50.991
Mr. Bhuller's wife - Cutie Bhuller.

1473
01:32:52.055 --> 01:32:57.211
She loves horses, but she loves
winning even more.

1474
01:32:57.383 --> 01:32:58.309
Ready for auction!

1475
01:33:00.718 --> 01:33:01.758
Here we go.

1476
01:33:01.939 --> 01:33:04.979
One, two, three!

1477
01:33:06.044 --> 01:33:12.440
Next one up for auction
is thorough bred 'Thunder'.

1478
01:33:13.121 --> 01:33:19.480
Reserve price is 50,000 Dirham
with an increment of 5000.

1479
01:33:20.950 --> 01:33:22.317
Lovely.

1480
01:33:22.617 --> 01:33:27.230
55,000 once... 55000 twice...

1481
01:33:27.906 --> 01:33:28.827
60.

1482
01:33:29.444 --> 01:33:31.368
We have another enthusiast.

1483
01:33:31.655 --> 01:33:32.781
60.

1484
01:33:33.341 --> 01:33:34.733
60,000 once...

1485
01:33:35.056 --> 01:33:37.105
here we go! 65.

1486
01:33:38.367 --> 01:33:44.296
Hey 70 - 80,000 incredible!

1487
01:33:45.190 --> 01:33:48.581
80... very good 90

1488
01:33:49.599 --> 01:33:50.831
95,000.

1489
01:33:52.073 --> 01:33:53.054
A 100,000.

1490
01:33:53.553 --> 01:33:55.011
Unbelievable!

1491
01:33:55.346 --> 01:33:59.954
Bunty control the missus,
before there's a storm in the desert!

1492
01:34:02.365 --> 01:34:03.956
Tread lightly love...

1493
01:34:04.330 --> 01:34:07.092
...we'll be out in the streets
if we have to pay!

1494
01:34:10.666 --> 01:34:12.632
135,000 once...

1495
01:34:13.718 --> 01:34:14.675
140!!!

1496
01:34:15.774 --> 01:34:20.145
Vimmi, if this goes south,
they'll even take Pappu away from us!

1497
01:34:20.375 --> 01:34:23.552
140,000 once... 140,000...
145!

1498
01:34:24.199 --> 01:34:26.275
Unbelievable! Oh my God!!!

1499
01:34:26.605 --> 01:34:27.918
150,000.

1500
01:34:28.286 --> 01:34:30.792
150,000 once... 150,000 twice...

1501
01:34:30.982 --> 01:34:31.944
Let's go.

1502
01:34:32.164 --> 01:34:33.765
150,000 thrice!

1503
01:34:34.039 --> 01:34:35.005
ABU DHABI EQUESTRIAN CLUB

1504
01:34:40.352 --> 01:34:43.030
Congratulations to the young man!

1505
01:34:44.639 --> 01:34:46.487
When is the idiot going to show up.

1506
01:34:46.796 --> 01:34:48.227
He will.

1507
01:34:53.488 --> 01:34:54.462
He's here.

1508
01:34:57.626 --> 01:34:58.576
Ready?

1509
01:35:08.165 --> 01:35:09.460
- Sorry.
- Yes.

1510
01:35:09.977 --> 01:35:12.371
I took all your caviar the other day.

1511
01:35:12.731 --> 01:35:14.333
I sincerely apologies.

1512
01:35:14.777 --> 01:35:17.095
Please accept this humble gift.

1513
01:35:17.639 --> 01:35:21.290
I gift you this beautiful horse.

1514
01:35:21.707 --> 01:35:22.458
Abdul?

1515
01:35:23.569 --> 01:35:29.744
Actually at 150,000 Dirham,
this horse is too cheap for me.

1516
01:35:30.516 --> 01:35:33.705
I think it suits you better.
Keep it.

1517
01:35:34.196 --> 01:35:36.332
Driver, drive!

1518
01:35:45.684 --> 01:35:46.985
What did you do?

1519
01:35:47.223 --> 01:35:47.867
What?

1520
01:35:48.065 --> 01:35:50.841
This was our chance to reel them in!

1521
01:35:51.033 --> 01:35:51.975
Calm down Rakesh.

1522
01:35:52.173 --> 01:35:56.150
Sweety there's no honey trap...
if we ain't got any honey!

1523
01:35:56.376 --> 01:35:58.256
We need money to pull this off...

1524
01:35:58.466 --> 01:36:01.179
...that horse was worth
at least a 150,000!

1525
01:36:01.394 --> 01:36:05.438
We've already spent half of what Uncle
took from them... in the last 4 days!

1526
01:36:05.830 --> 01:36:09.147
Take a chill-pill Rakesh.

1527
01:36:10.167 --> 01:36:12.994
And don't forget this is Bhuller
they are trying to woo...

1528
01:36:13.242 --> 01:36:15.329
...not some street-level thug.

1529
01:36:15.809 --> 01:36:17.192
Let them struggle...

1530
01:36:17.650 --> 01:36:21.273
...soon they won't be giving us this
200,000... but the entire 2 billion!

1531
01:36:32.539 --> 01:36:36.424
There's whack jobs...
and there's WHACK JOBS!

1532
01:36:36.657 --> 01:36:38.310
Which ones are these?

1533
01:36:38.784 --> 01:36:39.789
I can't even.

1534
01:36:41.044 --> 01:36:44.433
Baby, if you're all done, can I try?

1535
01:36:45.568 --> 01:36:49.109
Of course... the times -
they are a changin'!

1536
01:36:49.347 --> 01:36:51.606
But what you gonna do?

1537
01:36:51.989 --> 01:36:56.181
Indian or Emirati. There's only one
weakness men have.

1538
01:36:58.918 --> 01:37:00.954
We will be making an investment
in downtown.

1539
01:37:01.217 --> 01:37:02.874
- You get my files.
- Of course.

1540
01:37:03.326 --> 01:37:03.875
What?

1541
01:37:04.179 --> 01:37:07.052
I'm paying you 500 Dirhams a day.
Order your own food.

1542
01:37:07.968 --> 01:37:09.057
This is mine.

1543
01:37:10.693 --> 01:37:11.884
Rakesh, listen.

1544
01:37:12.198 --> 01:37:12.801
Yes, my queen?

1545
01:37:12.999 --> 01:37:16.033
We've waited all morning.
Maybe they won't show up today.

1546
01:37:16.231 --> 01:37:18.628
Right. It's a wrap for today.

1547
01:37:19.054 --> 01:37:21.483
At least we'll save on this loose
change expenses.

1548
01:37:22.281 --> 01:37:24.814
C'mon then... chop-chop.
Off you go.

1549
01:37:27.574 --> 01:37:30.649
It's time to get my money's worth.

1550
01:37:32.879 --> 01:37:36.294
Pappu, I promise I'll bring you
along next time.

1551
01:37:36.900 --> 01:37:41.510
Rakesh, my man... this is the life!

1552
01:37:53.219 --> 01:37:54.369
Attagirl!

1553
01:37:59.520 --> 01:38:02.401
There's a sight you don't see
in my hometown.

1554
01:38:04.195 --> 01:38:05.939
Nothing could be harder,

1555
01:38:06.642 --> 01:38:09.319
Blast from the 4x4 dancefloor,

1556
01:38:09.604 --> 01:38:12.332
Ever rising, awesome like parkour,

1557
01:38:13.293 --> 01:38:15.651
Jumping... its so easy,
my art form!

1558
01:38:15.989 --> 01:38:18.000
Can't believe they'd stoop this low!

1559
01:38:20.525 --> 01:38:21.711
She's headed right here!

1560
01:38:21.937 --> 01:38:25.127
Rakesh, you moron...
get out of there!

1561
01:38:30.605 --> 01:38:32.353
Play it cool Rakesh.

1562
01:38:37.465 --> 01:38:40.017
Swag on!

1563
01:38:44.530 --> 01:38:46.151
Where the hell is she going?

1564
01:38:52.289 --> 01:38:54.728
Mister Bhuller... right?

1565
01:38:55.112 --> 01:38:56.515
Rakesh, you rascal!

1566
01:38:57.695 --> 01:38:59.097
Who's asking?

1567
01:39:00.025 --> 01:39:02.364
Wow! You're from India too?

1568
01:39:04.964 --> 01:39:08.665
I've got some sunburn here...
but I can't reach it.

1569
01:39:09.293 --> 01:39:11.463
Can you please put this lotion on me?

1570
01:39:12.903 --> 01:39:14.067
Thank you!

1571
01:39:18.484 --> 01:39:21.536
If I do this, a shoe will
definitely fly into my face!

1572
01:39:23.665 --> 01:39:24.979
It's worth it!

1573
01:39:28.204 --> 01:39:28.934
Lotion!

1574
01:39:31.872 --> 01:39:36.422
Vimmi this brand might cost you
your husband!!!

1575
01:39:36.678 --> 01:39:40.196
Move aside you lifeguard...
how does this work?!

1576
01:39:41.072 --> 01:39:42.263
Yaaaa!

1577
01:39:48.329 --> 01:39:50.149
You have such a nice touch...

1578
01:39:50.623 --> 01:39:53.306
...and you're hands are so strong
Mr. Bhuller.

1579
01:39:54.419 --> 01:39:58.622
These hands have only been
checking tickets for 15 years...

1580
01:39:58.893 --> 01:40:00.501
...maybe it was all for this day.

1581
01:40:09.672 --> 01:40:10.949
I think I've seen you before.

1582
01:40:11.111 --> 01:40:12.505
That's right.

1583
01:40:12.748 --> 01:40:16.151
At the restaurant - the caviar...
and then at stud auction.

1584
01:40:16.401 --> 01:40:17.272
Yes.

1585
01:40:17.648 --> 01:40:20.352
But you still showed
so much maturity.

1586
01:40:20.631 --> 01:40:24.788
I don't know maybe that's
why I like older men.

1587
01:40:25.026 --> 01:40:26.357
Like older man!!

1588
01:40:26.581 --> 01:40:27.715
Be careful!

1589
01:40:31.379 --> 01:40:32.521
Where are you lost?

1590
01:40:33.007 --> 01:40:34.714
The lotion's all done.

1591
01:40:35.628 --> 01:40:36.630
I have to go now.

1592
01:40:37.053 --> 01:40:38.023
Out of my way!

1593
01:40:38.309 --> 01:40:39.287
Watch out!

1594
01:40:45.437 --> 01:40:46.264
What the hell.

1595
01:40:46.517 --> 01:40:47.500
Okay bye.

1596
01:40:52.227 --> 01:40:54.002
Rakesh, you stupid oaf!

1597
01:40:55.130 --> 01:40:57.546
Man, I'm in some serious trouble!

1598
01:40:59.131 --> 01:41:01.472
She had sprained her back Vimmi.

1599
01:41:01.668 --> 01:41:03.543
I was putting the ointment
on her back!

1600
01:41:03.763 --> 01:41:07.097
I know she's a woman...
but we are all humans first!

1601
01:41:07.285 --> 01:41:11.272
Stop trying to con me Rakesh!

1602
01:41:11.688 --> 01:41:14.296
I'm not like the village belles
of your small town.

1603
01:41:14.722 --> 01:41:16.394
I'm the Iron Lady of Uttar Pradesh!

1604
01:41:16.789 --> 01:41:19.581
I can't believe I've left my kid alone
for your shenanigans.

1605
01:41:20.411 --> 01:41:21.379
My shenanigans?!

1606
01:41:21.561 --> 01:41:22.757
Yes, yours!

1607
01:41:22.990 --> 01:41:27.438
And if you get on my nerves,
I'm gonna take Pappu and leave you!

1608
01:41:28.725 --> 01:41:31.563
Then you can dye your own hair
and wash your own underwear!

1609
01:41:31.976 --> 01:41:33.957
No more 'behind the scenes'.

1610
01:41:34.169 --> 01:41:36.297
I'm gonna be with you,
wherever you go!

1611
01:41:36.798 --> 01:41:40.269
Lemme see how human you are after all.

1612
01:41:51.509 --> 01:41:53.100
- Excuse me, Miss?
- Yes sir.

1613
01:41:53.399 --> 01:41:54.326
How much is buffet?

1614
01:41:54.498 --> 01:41:57.380
It's 233 Dirhams per person plus tax!

1615
01:41:59.524 --> 01:42:00.644
Okay, for two people.

1616
01:42:00.932 --> 01:42:02.563
Ya, you can sit anywhere.

1617
01:42:02.857 --> 01:42:04.154
- Thank you.
- Welcome.

1618
01:42:05.121 --> 01:42:05.664
Yes.

1619
01:42:05.962 --> 01:42:07.112
Bobby!

1620
01:42:09.204 --> 01:42:10.775
- Hi.
- Hi.

1621
01:42:11.159 --> 01:42:13.525
What fresh hell is this?

1622
01:42:13.789 --> 01:42:14.648
You are here.

1623
01:42:15.244 --> 01:42:17.951
And I was looking for you
on the sea front!

1624
01:42:19.091 --> 01:42:21.130
Uff... Nice suit.

1625
01:42:21.913 --> 01:42:22.537
Thanks.

1626
01:42:22.845 --> 01:42:24.579
God I have such a thing
for men in suits.

1627
01:42:26.032 --> 01:42:28.636
Nice... come lets have breakfast.

1628
01:42:29.325 --> 01:42:30.981
Come, don't be so so shy... come.

1629
01:42:32.561 --> 01:42:33.549
Come sit.

1630
01:42:36.320 --> 01:42:38.681
You know my boyfriend
also wanted to apologies,

1631
01:42:38.874 --> 01:42:40.643
he has been feeling so bad.

1632
01:42:41.427 --> 01:42:45.165
He's a little jealous...
but who wouldn't be?

1633
01:42:45.353 --> 01:42:47.273
I mean we hit it off
straight away, right?

1634
01:42:47.917 --> 01:42:48.601
Right.

1635
01:42:49.346 --> 01:42:52.415
- Is your boyfriend Emirati?
- Yes.

1636
01:42:52.654 --> 01:42:53.991
- And you're Indian?
- Yes.

1637
01:42:54.173 --> 01:42:55.024
How come?

1638
01:42:55.469 --> 01:42:57.374
Oh my god, it's really funny story!

1639
01:42:57.608 --> 01:42:59.472
I was born in Ludhiana...
studied in London.

1640
01:42:59.634 --> 01:43:02.740
We met at Harrods one day.
Oh my God, its love at first site.

1641
01:43:02.988 --> 01:43:04.956
He was like..."babe you are mine..."
- I said okay.

1642
01:43:06.834 --> 01:43:09.803
That's all it took?

1643
01:43:10.614 --> 01:43:14.326
That's all it takes these days
you know.

1644
01:43:22.149 --> 01:43:23.122
What?

1645
01:43:23.549 --> 01:43:25.748
- Hi, meet my-
- I know who she is.

1646
01:43:26.204 --> 01:43:27.167
Hi.

1647
01:43:27.734 --> 01:43:29.421
- And she is-
- Snooty Bhuller.

1648
01:43:29.685 --> 01:43:30.415
Sorry?

1649
01:43:30.628 --> 01:43:34.133
Cutie Bhuller...
why, what did you hear?

1650
01:43:34.979 --> 01:43:37.065
So cute! Please sit no?

1651
01:43:37.572 --> 01:43:39.507
It's so nice to meet you.

1652
01:43:39.954 --> 01:43:42.892
You are such a lucky woman
to have him as your husband.

1653
01:43:43.125 --> 01:43:46.700
Women must be falling over
each other to marry a man like him.

1654
01:43:49.235 --> 01:43:50.395
So handsome.

1655
01:43:50.720 --> 01:43:53.394
Morning, beautiful people...darling.

1656
01:43:55.467 --> 01:43:57.331
You know Bobby I was
just talking about you.

1657
01:43:57.513 --> 01:43:58.309
Love it.

1658
01:43:58.546 --> 01:44:02.140
You look like my morning butter...
wanna put you on bread and eat.

1659
01:44:04.608 --> 01:44:06.614
Sorry for the auction Sir... Ma'am.

1660
01:44:06.877 --> 01:44:08.454
No, no... it's okay.

1661
01:44:10.332 --> 01:44:12.286
You are so kind hearted bobby.

1662
01:44:12.814 --> 01:44:15.241
We are here on a short trip...
we'll leave soon.

1663
01:44:15.495 --> 01:44:18.615
We would be really happy
if you accept the beautiful horse.

1664
01:44:19.050 --> 01:44:23.974
Ya please you should...
please, pretty please for me.

1665
01:44:24.826 --> 01:44:25.535
OKAY!

1666
01:44:25.718 --> 01:44:26.324
Okay.

1667
01:44:26.543 --> 01:44:27.647
Not okay!!!

1668
01:44:28.227 --> 01:44:29.177
Not okay?

1669
01:44:30.565 --> 01:44:33.311
What is this?!
Do you know who I am?

1670
01:44:33.752 --> 01:44:36.030
I'm the Money laundering Queen -
Cutie Bhuller!

1671
01:44:36.264 --> 01:44:41.730
I can move billions of dollars across
continents with a single phone call.

1672
01:44:42.333 --> 01:44:46.845
It takes people a lifetime
to even share a table with me...

1673
01:44:47.683 --> 01:44:50.044
...and you think you
can just waltz in here?!

1674
01:44:50.302 --> 01:44:51.320
Get up!

1675
01:44:55.435 --> 01:44:57.998
You're making a scene Cutie.

1676
01:44:58.698 --> 01:44:59.906
Be quiet!

1677
01:45:00.395 --> 01:45:02.305
You think you're a bit stud?

1678
01:45:02.786 --> 01:45:07.796
Dude I from the Wild wild west
of India.

1679
01:45:08.116 --> 01:45:09.393
You're new money, aren't you?

1680
01:45:09.596 --> 01:45:11.764
I can't see much of a pedigree here.

1681
01:45:12.985 --> 01:45:13.838
And you!

1682
01:45:14.626 --> 01:45:16.799
What's with this 'Bobby' nonsense?

1683
01:45:17.332 --> 01:45:20.292
Did nobody ever teach you
any manners?

1684
01:45:20.669 --> 01:45:22.611
- Actually...
- Shut it... or I'll shoot it!

1685
01:45:25.494 --> 01:45:26.715
Actually what?

1686
01:45:27.581 --> 01:45:30.970
You thinks we are your "bffs"?!

1687
01:45:32.221 --> 01:45:35.701
Don't you get too smart...
or too familiar.

1688
01:45:38.305 --> 01:45:40.509
Bobby bloody Bhuller... It seems!

1689
01:45:48.377 --> 01:45:49.253
Fiery woman.

1690
01:45:49.512 --> 01:45:50.060
Yeah.

1691
01:45:50.286 --> 01:45:52.140
That's why I love her.

1692
01:45:52.504 --> 01:45:54.733
Let me rein her in a little.

1693
01:45:55.549 --> 01:45:56.395
Good day.

1694
01:45:56.562 --> 01:45:59.667
Good day! Ya, ya... you are the man.
Go get her.

1695
01:46:01.736 --> 01:46:04.699
Oh man... things just got complicated.

1696
01:46:05.211 --> 01:46:07.385
No... it just got bloody simple.

1697
01:46:07.613 --> 01:46:10.070
Bhuller lady just gave away
her identity.

1698
01:46:10.421 --> 01:46:12.368
We don't need these cons anymore...

1699
01:46:12.563 --> 01:46:14.150
...from now on,
honesty is the best policy!

1700
01:46:14.330 --> 01:46:16.464
Well done baby. Let's go.

1701
01:46:17.061 --> 01:46:20.253
Vimmi-Vimmi, listen to me!

1702
01:46:21.089 --> 01:46:22.477
- Vimmi.
- What is it?

1703
01:46:22.846 --> 01:46:23.945
What was that?!

1704
01:46:24.143 --> 01:46:25.961
Why'd you have to make a scene?

1705
01:46:26.159 --> 01:46:27.143
I was managing it!

1706
01:46:27.882 --> 01:46:29.650
What were you managing, Rakesh?

1707
01:46:29.995 --> 01:46:33.586
That chick's calling you 'Bobby' while
your wife's sitting right next to you!

1708
01:46:34.087 --> 01:46:35.901
If you're done with me...
with this marriage...

1709
01:46:36.078 --> 01:46:37.702
...just come out with it
and tell me.

1710
01:46:37.983 --> 01:46:41.686
My god Vimmi, you've lost your mind...
what are you saying?

1711
01:46:42.066 --> 01:46:43.241
I know what you're up.

1712
01:46:43.526 --> 01:46:46.845
You pretend like you care about our
brand, but I know what's going on!

1713
01:46:47.169 --> 01:46:49.889
You went off script with your character
so I changed our story.

1714
01:46:50.117 --> 01:46:52.691
Who says a man has to be
the Kingpin...

1715
01:46:52.913 --> 01:46:54.301
...why can't there be a Queen-pin?!

1716
01:46:54.468 --> 01:46:57.215
You think I'm acting funny?

1717
01:46:58.036 --> 01:47:00.929
Why didn't you take the horse...
like we'd planned to!

1718
01:47:01.168 --> 01:47:03.893
We could've got going
then itself... But no!

1719
01:47:04.354 --> 01:47:06.376
You wanted to make things
'challenging'.

1720
01:47:06.658 --> 01:47:08.720
You didn't think they'll try
something else?

1721
01:47:09.014 --> 01:47:11.420
Go ahead... be the Queen-pin!

1722
01:47:11.622 --> 01:47:13.821
Lemme see how you lead this con,
I won't say a word.

1723
01:47:14.140 --> 01:47:16.982
Sure. I will lead... way better
than you ever did!

1724
01:47:17.205 --> 01:47:19.964
- Oh I can't wait to see!
- And see you will.

1725
01:47:26.399 --> 01:47:29.693
Men will always be men.
Is the plan still on?

1726
01:47:30.377 --> 01:47:32.312
Why don't you go ask the Queen-pin?!

1727
01:47:33.117 --> 01:47:34.541
What's wrong with you?

1728
01:47:37.685 --> 01:47:39.496
Looks like the idiot just hit the fan!

1729
01:47:42.838 --> 01:47:45.422
Hi ma'am would you like to sample
our new cocktail please?

1730
01:47:45.802 --> 01:47:46.582
Is it free?

1731
01:47:46.800 --> 01:47:47.786
Yes ma'am...
It's a sample!

1732
01:47:48.061 --> 01:47:49.143
Gimme a dozen.

1733
01:47:49.544 --> 01:47:51.009
Keep 5-6.

1734
01:47:53.547 --> 01:47:54.879
Thank you ma'am, enjoy!

1735
01:48:03.297 --> 01:48:04.412
Free samples, huh.

1736
01:48:05.522 --> 01:48:08.678
I doubt it tastes anything like
our drinks back home cutie ma'am.

1737
01:48:09.555 --> 01:48:12.645
One dressing down... and you've gone
from Arab Cocktails to Indian drinks.

1738
01:48:13.122 --> 01:48:14.524
If I'd gone 'Indian' straight up,

1739
01:48:14.700 --> 01:48:16.681
...you would have thrown
a slipper at my head.

1740
01:48:17.203 --> 01:48:22.601
To be honest, I think all this
new money got to our heads.

1741
01:48:23.060 --> 01:48:26.997
We forgot our manners and our place.

1742
01:48:27.354 --> 01:48:31.792
Hope you can let bygones be bygones
and forgive our childishness?

1743
01:48:32.318 --> 01:48:33.292
A child?

1744
01:48:33.843 --> 01:48:35.679
As compared to you two.

1745
01:48:36.603 --> 01:48:40.099
We tried hard to reach you
via Bobby sir, but all in vain.

1746
01:48:40.486 --> 01:48:43.187
We thought we could trick you
into helping us.

1747
01:48:43.695 --> 01:48:47.336
We need to launder
about 2 Billion rupees...

1748
01:48:47.798 --> 01:48:52.038
...but we were worried
you won't take us seriously.

1749
01:48:53.301 --> 01:48:54.831
This is our last try.

1750
01:48:55.093 --> 01:48:56.296
If you disapprove,

1751
01:48:56.513 --> 01:48:59.058
I swear we will never show
our faces again.

1752
01:48:59.862 --> 01:49:03.103
Sorry for all the trouble...
and thank you Ma'am!

1753
01:49:07.683 --> 01:49:10.961
I appreciate the honesty,
what state are you from?

1754
01:49:12.129 --> 01:49:13.756
Uttar Pradesh Ma'am... In the north.

1755
01:49:14.168 --> 01:49:15.926
That makes us neighbours.

1756
01:49:16.911 --> 01:49:19.297
Let's meet for dinner tomorrow
at my suite.

1757
01:49:19.520 --> 01:49:20.827
Get your baby too.

1758
01:49:21.024 --> 01:49:23.942
So... Is that a 'Yes'?

1759
01:49:24.272 --> 01:49:26.404
- Dinner. Tomorrow night.
- Okay.

1760
01:49:26.587 --> 01:49:28.223
I don't feel like working right now.

1761
01:49:28.588 --> 01:49:31.233
I am working on my tan.

1762
01:49:31.729 --> 01:49:35.730
Can I just say,
how perfect that tan is! Okay.

1763
01:49:36.743 --> 01:49:39.149
I'll see you at the party.

1764
01:49:40.587 --> 01:49:41.909
Thank you, ma'am.

1765
01:49:48.392 --> 01:49:49.013
Cheers.

1766
01:49:49.277 --> 01:49:53.440
My friends... this world has
two kinds of people.

1767
01:49:53.920 --> 01:49:55.963
One - the kinds who walk a straight...

1768
01:49:56.185 --> 01:49:58.036
...honest path and sleep
peacefully at night.

1769
01:49:58.231 --> 01:50:01.199
And Two - the kinds
who take the crooked...

1770
01:50:01.397 --> 01:50:04.778
...twisted path and live as
if every night is their last.

1771
01:50:05.470 --> 01:50:08.189
We belong to the second kind...

1772
01:50:09.215 --> 01:50:12.143
...and soon you guys will too.

1773
01:50:12.817 --> 01:50:16.086
So let's party like this literally
is the last night of your free lives!

1774
01:50:16.381 --> 01:50:18.943
Like there's no tomorrow.

1775
01:50:19.203 --> 01:50:20.341
Well said!

1776
01:50:22.904 --> 01:50:25.550
You're going off track
and headed for a crash.

1777
01:50:26.419 --> 01:50:29.829
Stop over acting.
They are already sold.

1778
01:50:30.330 --> 01:50:31.579
Give me a minute Vimmi.

1779
01:50:32.099 --> 01:50:33.019
Vimmi?

1780
01:50:34.499 --> 01:50:37.257
Isn't her name Cutie?
Cutie Bhuller?

1781
01:50:37.701 --> 01:50:38.245
No.

1782
01:50:40.160 --> 01:50:44.990
She's Vimmi, and I am Rakesh
from Fursatganj, Uttar Pradesh.

1783
01:50:45.820 --> 01:50:49.949
It's the money laundering that
made us Bobby and Cutie Bhuller.

1784
01:50:51.538 --> 01:50:52.478
Right Cutie?

1785
01:50:54.099 --> 01:50:57.030
Have you guys heard
of Bunty and Babli?

1786
01:50:57.773 --> 01:50:59.948
No, who're they?

1787
01:51:01.087 --> 01:51:03.918
Legends... also from small
town India. Like us.

1788
01:51:04.470 --> 01:51:05.602
So what?

1789
01:51:05.834 --> 01:51:08.473
All this money...
we haven't earned it -

1790
01:51:08.795 --> 01:51:13.172
we ripped off a corrupt politician doing
what we learnt from Bunty and Babli.

1791
01:51:13.642 --> 01:51:19.344
I bet that's what these real
Bunty and Babli would've done!

1792
01:51:20.464 --> 01:51:22.676
Where is it now?

1793
01:51:23.219 --> 01:51:23.907
Who?

1794
01:51:24.403 --> 01:51:24.868
THAT.

1795
01:51:25.909 --> 01:51:28.497
Oh... the cash is safe back home.

1796
01:51:29.151 --> 01:51:31.322
We can get it where you say
at 2 days notice.

1797
01:51:31.732 --> 01:51:33.371
Get the money to Delhi.

1798
01:51:33.891 --> 01:51:35.713
Done! Where in Delhi?

1799
01:51:36.327 --> 01:51:39.306
Bobby, where in Delhi?

1800
01:51:47.963 --> 01:51:49.452
Ma'am, your grace too.

1801
01:51:50.242 --> 01:51:51.148
Sure.

1802
01:51:52.163 --> 01:51:54.471
To our under construction building.

1803
01:51:54.671 --> 01:51:56.623
Cheers... once more, for 2 Billion!

1804
01:51:56.915 --> 01:51:57.705
Cheers!

1805
01:52:08.365 --> 01:52:09.341
2 Billion?

1806
01:52:09.910 --> 01:52:11.277
Just imagine!

1807
01:52:11.591 --> 01:52:14.006
I feel like you deserve a cut too.

1808
01:52:14.496 --> 01:52:16.519
What am I going to do with 2000?

1809
01:52:16.914 --> 01:52:20.054
At best I'll take the whole class for
snacks... and turn into Mr. Popular!

1810
01:52:20.247 --> 01:52:21.717
You need to think big Pappu.

1811
01:52:22.055 --> 01:52:24.504
What then? 200,000?

1812
01:52:25.658 --> 01:52:26.427
Come on!

1813
01:52:27.458 --> 01:52:28.751
How much then?

1814
01:52:29.080 --> 01:52:34.004
You're the heir apparent boy...

1815
01:52:35.470 --> 01:52:38.444
...you deserve at least 20 million!

1816
01:52:39.047 --> 01:52:43.377
007. Always think big! How much?

1817
01:52:43.732 --> 01:52:44.972
20 million!

1818
01:52:45.336 --> 01:52:48.303
Pappu's 20 million!

1819
01:52:48.895 --> 01:52:49.958
20 bloody million!

1820
01:52:50.442 --> 01:52:54.143
I want 20 million...
I'm the heir apparent!

1821
01:52:54.834 --> 01:52:55.768
Moron!

1822
01:52:56.001 --> 01:52:58.165
Okay... I'll make do with 2000 then.

1823
01:52:58.398 --> 01:53:01.054
- Do want 2000 slaps instead?
- No mummy, I'm sorry!

1824
01:53:01.266 --> 01:53:03.244
It'll be a miracle if you pass
your mid terms!

1825
01:53:03.509 --> 01:53:04.956
20 million slaps you'll get.

1826
01:53:05.564 --> 01:53:08.093
Yo, Mr. Bobby Bhuller...
can we leave?

1827
01:53:08.251 --> 01:53:10.299
We have a train to catch!
Hurry up!

1828
01:53:10.611 --> 01:53:12.829
DELHI - INDIA

1829
01:53:18.764 --> 01:53:19.767
Is this okay?

1830
01:53:21.863 --> 01:53:22.766
Yes!

1831
01:53:27.982 --> 01:53:30.400
They'll get here first...
and then Jatayu will.

1832
01:53:30.987 --> 01:53:35.353
Till then we will have
all the proof we need.

1833
01:53:35.954 --> 01:53:37.254
Except for one thing.

1834
01:53:37.881 --> 01:53:38.599
What?

1835
01:53:39.345 --> 01:53:44.766
I've seen you get fresh with that pretty
young thing... these last few days.

1836
01:53:45.745 --> 01:53:49.339
Tell me straight up Rakesh,
if our love is one-sided now.

1837
01:53:49.958 --> 01:53:54.656
Here I am trying to stay in shape...
dolling up every day,

1838
01:53:54.847 --> 01:53:59.259
wearing Sabyasachi knock offs...
these blow drys.

1839
01:53:59.627 --> 01:54:02.691
Make up and what not!
Who do you think it's for?

1840
01:54:03.054 --> 01:54:06.882
Who do you think I paint
these stars on my nails for?!

1841
01:54:07.145 --> 01:54:09.204
I can't believe we're still
discussing this!?

1842
01:54:09.429 --> 01:54:11.903
I need an answer Rakesh!

1843
01:54:12.490 --> 01:54:15.239
Tell me, are you bored of me?!

1844
01:54:15.760 --> 01:54:17.307
Be honest. I won't feel bad.

1845
01:54:17.497 --> 01:54:18.809
Yes, I'm bored!

1846
01:54:19.163 --> 01:54:23.701
I'm bored with your constant
unhappiness!

1847
01:54:24.601 --> 01:54:29.202
Do you remember the last time
you smiled at me?

1848
01:54:29.769 --> 01:54:32.554
You know these cons
are like a game of poker...

1849
01:54:32.969 --> 01:54:36.535
...you can't let on when you
are bluffing, if you want to win.

1850
01:54:37.193 --> 01:54:39.919
All I did was stay in character Vimmi.

1851
01:54:41.654 --> 01:54:46.169
God knows I've never breached
protocol in the last 15 years.

1852
01:54:47.705 --> 01:54:49.652
I may sway to a beat here there...

1853
01:54:49.930 --> 01:54:53.505
...but you're the only song
in my heart Vimmi Trivedi!

1854
01:54:54.866 --> 01:54:57.354
Is that true?
Swear on Pappu?

1855
01:54:57.782 --> 01:55:02.712
I swear... on Pappu, our railway colony
and by every person in our entire town!

1856
01:55:07.998 --> 01:55:09.047
I am sorry!

1857
01:55:09.708 --> 01:55:10.671
What?

1858
01:55:11.509 --> 01:55:13.865
I said I'm sorry. Idiot.

1859
01:55:16.895 --> 01:55:18.841
Better get warmed up now.

1860
01:55:19.528 --> 01:55:23.059
We need to get our revenge
before Jatayu Singh gets here.

1861
01:55:55.620 --> 01:55:56.656
Got the cash?

1862
01:55:57.110 --> 01:55:59.082
- It's in the car.
- Show me the bags!

1863
01:56:09.689 --> 01:56:11.211
Load them in the car.

1864
01:56:25.060 --> 01:56:28.219
All your money will be transferred
to a foreign bank account by tomorrow.

1865
01:56:28.625 --> 01:56:29.571
Thanks.

1866
01:56:30.408 --> 01:56:32.346
- Thank you sir.
- You can go.

1867
01:56:51.219 --> 01:56:52.246
Kunal.

1868
01:57:04.550 --> 01:57:07.082
Get up my child.

1869
01:57:09.099 --> 01:57:18.515
Are you wondering why your whole
world has just turned upside down?

1870
01:57:21.569 --> 01:57:24.632
I designed that Bunty and Babli
calling card.

1871
01:57:25.059 --> 01:57:27.331
I selected the colour, it's scheme...

1872
01:57:27.481 --> 01:57:29.380
...and each and every
detail like... what's it called?

1873
01:57:29.570 --> 01:57:32.819
- Font.
- Yes, the font! I chose that.

1874
01:57:33.525 --> 01:57:38.806
And this name, Bunty and Babli,
that you've been parading around...

1875
01:57:39.012 --> 01:57:41.661
...was the result of our brilliance.

1876
01:57:42.125 --> 01:57:47.214
You small time thugs thought
you could replace us?!

1877
01:57:47.563 --> 01:57:50.876
You thought you could just
mooch off our brand...

1878
01:57:51.060 --> 01:57:53.051
...by plastering it wherever
you feel like?

1879
01:57:53.315 --> 01:57:56.706
Now we'll plaster your faces
on tomorrow's papers.

1880
01:57:57.420 --> 01:57:58.917
Jatayu Singh will be here any moment.

1881
01:57:59.140 --> 01:58:01.713
You're looking at a minimum
of 10 years.

1882
01:58:02.125 --> 01:58:04.886
Not to mention what Mrs. Lovely
will do with you.

1883
01:58:05.251 --> 01:58:09.961
Get ready to rot in jail.

1884
01:58:11.123 --> 01:58:14.697
So you guys are the real
Bunty and Babli?

1885
01:58:16.027 --> 01:58:16.802
Word.

1886
01:58:18.058 --> 01:58:20.899
Damn! We shouldn't have done this.

1887
01:58:21.123 --> 01:58:22.204
Wait, I'll handle this.

1888
01:58:22.387 --> 01:58:25.544
I knew we were going to get caught
one day... if we keep doing it!

1889
01:58:25.706 --> 01:58:26.680
Lemme talk.

1890
01:58:26.862 --> 01:58:29.225
I should've never agreed
to your stupid idea...

1891
01:58:29.556 --> 01:58:32.196
I should have just said 'No'
to doing it one last time as well!

1892
01:58:32.455 --> 01:58:33.603
Just calm down Sonia.

1893
01:58:33.790 --> 01:58:35.018
You're asking me to calm down?!

1894
01:58:35.252 --> 01:58:36.881
I have a single mother dude.

1895
01:58:37.146 --> 01:58:38.587
How is she gonna live without me?!

1896
01:58:38.899 --> 01:58:40.561
Stop this fake drama.

1897
01:58:41.908 --> 01:58:44.842
We have used this same
sad story many time!

1898
01:58:48.551 --> 01:58:50.617
We don't do this because we enjoy it.

1899
01:58:52.221 --> 01:58:54.450
Anybody who breaks the law,
does it for a reason.

1900
01:58:54.726 --> 01:58:56.730
For some it's revenge, greed,
or ambition.

1901
01:58:56.897 --> 01:58:58.479
Ours, was frustration.

1902
01:58:59.492 --> 01:59:03.448
India runs on a special fuel...
that's unique only to us -

1903
01:59:03.969 --> 01:59:05.575
we call it 'Jugaad' or cutting corners.

1904
01:59:05.939 --> 01:59:09.034
Dad couldn't afford a private hospital
for my birth.

1905
01:59:09.229 --> 01:59:12.667
He first needed 'Jugaad' for a hospital
bed in a government hospital.

1906
01:59:13.198 --> 01:59:15.010
And then for admission
in an English medium school

1907
01:59:15.203 --> 01:59:16.259
for a special tutor.

1908
01:59:16.412 --> 01:59:18.157
Jugaad to get me into
the local Cricket team...

1909
01:59:18.362 --> 01:59:20.573
...he used this jugaad to even
get me internet on my phone!

1910
01:59:22.508 --> 01:59:24.218
I saw him cut corners all his life...

1911
01:59:24.954 --> 01:59:26.655
...and grew up thinking.

1912
01:59:27.127 --> 01:59:30.959
Maybe this is the only way - Jugaad!

1913
01:59:32.209 --> 01:59:34.254
This same jugaad got me
to an engineering college...

1914
01:59:34.532 --> 01:59:38.888
...but even there I couldn't get by
a single day without cutting corners.

1915
01:59:39.629 --> 01:59:43.639
In spite of hundreds of thousands in fees
and tall claims of "job security".

1916
01:59:44.136 --> 01:59:48.608
Not even 20% of the graduates
get a job.

1917
01:59:48.958 --> 01:59:50.461
And then some survey
will declare that...

1918
01:59:50.626 --> 01:59:52.987
90% of graduates are unfit
for employment!

1919
01:59:53.510 --> 01:59:55.556
But does anyone stop to ask
why is that so?

1920
01:59:55.860 --> 01:59:57.852
And why doesn't it change?

1921
02:00:00.962 --> 02:00:04.327
My graduation had wiped out
my parents' savings.

1922
02:00:04.840 --> 02:00:07.317
I didn't know what to do.

1923
02:00:07.987 --> 02:00:10.743
When it occurred to me if the system
is designed to steal from us...

1924
02:00:11.160 --> 02:00:13.548
...why not con the system itself?

1925
02:00:14.180 --> 02:00:16.770
And that's why we decided we're
going to con agents of this 'jugaad'

1926
02:00:16.989 --> 02:00:18.938
and expose the system for what it is...

1927
02:00:19.197 --> 02:00:20.979
...and in the process,
fulfil our own dreams.

1928
02:00:21.192 --> 02:00:22.741
Tell me what exactly
did we do wrong?

1929
02:00:25.462 --> 02:00:30.833
We grew up listening Bunty and Babli's
exploits... on TV and newspapers.

1930
02:00:31.154 --> 02:00:34.258
As soon as we graduated,
you became our role models.

1931
02:00:36.144 --> 02:00:39.553
We thought, like you guys,
we too will never get caught.

1932
02:00:41.108 --> 02:00:43.976
We only keep 10% of the money
we make... and give away the rest.

1933
02:00:45.246 --> 02:00:49.910
We forgot that our misdeeds are bound
to catch up with us one day.

1934
02:00:52.518 --> 02:00:55.187
So here we are... and our money.

1935
02:00:56.016 --> 02:00:58.099
You can do what you want with us.

1936
02:01:02.330 --> 02:01:06.426
Vimmi, the world is made up
of two kinds of people.

1937
02:01:07.259 --> 02:01:10.995
One - The kinds who sidestep a pothole
on the road and move on with their life.

1938
02:01:11.339 --> 02:01:14.980
Two - The kind that stops...
and asks who did this?

1939
02:01:15.268 --> 02:01:17.949
For what joy?
And when will it be filled?

1940
02:01:18.818 --> 02:01:22.930
And there's a third kind... people
like you, who can see the pothole...

1941
02:01:23.146 --> 02:01:25.353
...and yet feel the urge
to fall into it!

1942
02:01:26.645 --> 02:01:29.043
Stop being such a softie Rakesh.

1943
02:01:33.318 --> 02:01:35.457
Didn't we also get cheated
by the same system?

1944
02:01:35.613 --> 02:01:37.632
That's why we became Bunty and Babli.

1945
02:01:37.841 --> 02:01:44.881
I believe if they are repentant, they
should get a chance to make amends.

1946
02:01:47.865 --> 02:01:50.481
Isn't that the same thing
Inspector Dashrath Singh did for us?

1947
02:01:51.216 --> 02:01:52.629
Remember Vimmi?

1948
02:01:53.124 --> 02:01:56.855
You know I get emotional
when you talk about Dashrath uncle.

1949
02:02:17.896 --> 02:02:20.139
What the hell is this?
Where are those two?

1950
02:02:20.404 --> 02:02:22.094
Sir they fooled us and fled!

1951
02:02:23.272 --> 02:02:26.140
But we've recovered the money...
the entire 2 Billion.

1952
02:02:26.510 --> 02:02:27.920
It's in that van.

1953
02:02:30.493 --> 02:02:33.347
They fooled you and fled...
but left all their money behind?

1954
02:02:33.980 --> 02:02:36.063
Can you explain that rubbish logic?

1955
02:02:36.772 --> 02:02:39.050
As soon as they heard
Jatayu Singh is coming...

1956
02:02:39.253 --> 02:02:41.981
they started shivering in their pants
and scampered away!

1957
02:02:42.572 --> 02:02:47.461
Vimmi dear... that's a great story
for stoking my ego...

1958
02:02:48.942 --> 02:02:51.666
but as far as logic goes...
that is complete poppycock!

1959
02:02:54.268 --> 02:02:56.525
You can go ahead and check the van.

1960
02:03:00.184 --> 02:03:04.696
Incredible! Flabbergasting...
Mind blasting!!!

1961
02:03:05.621 --> 02:03:08.969
Katrina, Priyanka, Bipasha has
replaced Gandhi on the notes!

1962
02:03:09.537 --> 02:03:12.563
These notes look fake.

1963
02:03:13.231 --> 02:03:18.555
Dear Former Bunty, they don't
just look fake, they are fake!

1964
02:03:19.434 --> 02:03:20.945
They've fooled us again!

1965
02:03:23.313 --> 02:03:25.686
But I checked the 3 bags myself...

1966
02:03:25.997 --> 02:03:28.738
I told you... You've gone soft.

1967
02:03:28.979 --> 02:03:33.061
If you can fool them for 30 days
by thinking like them...

1968
02:03:33.457 --> 02:03:36.682
...then why can't they do the same
to you and fool you with 3 bags?

1969
02:03:36.993 --> 02:03:39.537
There's real currency
on the surface...

1970
02:03:39.880 --> 02:03:41.211
...but the bags are full of fake notes.

1971
02:03:41.478 --> 02:03:42.760
I know Gupta.

1972
02:03:43.267 --> 02:03:44.951
What about the video recording?

1973
02:03:45.337 --> 02:03:51.991
I deleted the video
after we let them go.

1974
02:03:53.140 --> 02:03:54.345
What could we do?

1975
02:03:54.637 --> 02:03:56.369
We thought they were repentant...

1976
02:03:56.579 --> 02:03:58.483
...and wanted to give them
a chance to make amends.

1977
02:03:58.781 --> 02:03:59.795
Are you a court judge?

1978
02:04:00.444 --> 02:04:02.817
Or the police?

1979
02:04:03.276 --> 02:04:05.629
Who gave you the goddamn
right to decide?

1980
02:04:06.088 --> 02:04:07.855
Tell, me who gave you the right?

1981
02:04:08.279 --> 02:04:10.436
Um... Even Dashrath Singh...

1982
02:04:10.632 --> 02:04:12.028
Not a word. He's retired now.

1983
02:04:12.213 --> 02:04:14.370
The phone's ringing.

1984
02:04:15.359 --> 02:04:15.944
UNKNOWN NUMBER

1985
02:04:17.136 --> 02:04:18.170
Who is it?

1986
02:04:21.904 --> 02:04:23.659
Greetings Mr. Bunty... and Mrs. Babli

1987
02:04:23.932 --> 02:04:26.216
Just tell me where you are,
you rascal?

1988
02:04:26.508 --> 02:04:30.340
If I see you I am going to make sure you
won't be able to greet anyone again!

1989
02:04:30.615 --> 02:04:33.831
I know you guys are pissed about
the fake notes, but think about it.

1990
02:04:34.116 --> 02:04:41.029
How could we pass on the chance
to scam the real Bunty and Babli?!

1991
02:04:41.350 --> 02:04:44.763
You're telling me, you knew we were
the real Bunty and Babli, all along?

1992
02:04:45.157 --> 02:04:47.734
When you took your wallet out
on the night of the party.

1993
02:04:54.797 --> 02:04:56.555
I saw something I wasn't meant to.

1994
02:04:56.777 --> 02:04:58.291
You can't handle your drink.

1995
02:04:58.497 --> 02:05:02.411
It was nice to see you still carry your
calling card even after all these years.

1996
02:05:02.748 --> 02:05:06.313
And that hour long rant about Jugaad
and the system... was all a farce?

1997
02:05:06.720 --> 02:05:12.703
No. We did get a little too greedy
and selfish about our aspirations,

1998
02:05:13.160 --> 02:05:15.767
when we landed this kind of money.

1999
02:05:16.218 --> 02:05:19.701
But then we recollected the reason that
inspired us to become Bunty and Babli.

2000
02:05:19.977 --> 02:05:23.211
And so, in the interest of the general
public, we're re-entering the game.

2001
02:05:23.713 --> 02:05:25.520
There's no point coming after us...

2002
02:05:25.728 --> 02:05:27.271
...because we ain't getting
caught again!

2003
02:05:27.489 --> 02:05:28.983
So don't waste your time.

2004
02:05:29.165 --> 02:05:31.273
- Take care and sleep tight!
- Take care.

2005
02:05:36.443 --> 02:05:40.273
Bunty and Babli...
Bunty and Babli..!

2006
02:05:41.740 --> 02:05:45.806
You have once again besmirched
your own good name...as well as mine.

2007
02:05:46.292 --> 02:05:49.155
I was wrong... you guys are useless!

2008
02:05:49.602 --> 02:05:51.359
Please return to your domestic life...

2009
02:05:51.810 --> 02:05:54.869
