02:06:30.320 --> 02:06:36.672
From none other than the master
fraudsters - Bunty and Babli!

2021
02:06:37.205 --> 02:06:39.799
This money was transferred from
an account registered in Abu Dhabu...

2022
02:06:39.989 --> 02:06:43.118
...under their name -
Bunty-Babli and Co.

2023
02:06:43.423 --> 02:06:46.121
- No one knows why..."
- There's a courier for you.

