Mr. Bunty and Mrs. Babli!

2027
02:07:12.007 --> 02:07:14.438
Your plan was outstanding!

2028
02:07:18.400 --> 02:07:20.430
If we hand this money to Jatayu,

2029
02:07:20.735 --> 02:07:22.749
