and run away.

2032
02:07:30.393 --> 02:07:34.544
5% brand licensing fees
with perpetuity, is that too much?

2033
02:07:34.778 --> 02:07:35.723
Perpetu... What?

2034
02:07:36.180 --> 02:07:37.662
Perpetuity...

2035
02:07:37.947 --> 02:07:41.459
They pay us, as long as
they use the brand.

2036
02:07:45.703 --> 02:07:50.053
The police are on their way...
you have two options right now.

2037
02:07:50.383 --> 02:07:52.692
Option A, surrender and repent.

2038
02:07:53.013 --> 02:07:56.221
Or option B, do as we say.

2039
02:07:56.759 --> 02:08:00.302
Whatever you do,
just remember one thing...

2040
02:08:01.175 --> 02:08:04.287
